(1158706, 145071, 27514, '<td valign="top">very nice concept, but I find to major things wrong with this picture. First of all there is a killer red cast that doesn''t look like it was suppose to be there and it just makes the whites in the picture look very dirt. Two the instrament doesn''t fit the wound on the wrist, it doesn''t even appear to be open on the floor. I am not going to vote you down on that don''t worry but just some insite. I like the concept, all you needed to do was fix that color cast and mabey change the males shoes, they are a little distracting and you could have been in the top 10 easy. (by the way I''m giving you a seven, and I''m sorry I can''t spell anything)</td>', 'very nice concept, but I find to major things wrong with this picture. First of all there is a killer red cast that doesn''t look like it was suppose to be there and it just makes the whites in the picture look very dirt. Two the instrament doesn''t fit the wound on the wrist, it doesn''t even appear to be open on the floor. I am not going to vote you down on that don''t worry but just some insite. I like the concept, all you needed to do was fix that color cast and mabey change the males shoes, they are a little distracting and you could have been in the top 10 easy. (by the way I''m giving you a seven, and I''m sorry I can''t spell anything)', '2005-02-09 00:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
