(1159374, 143173, 24073, '<td valign="top">I gave you a great score, and I am glad to see somebody put it in the challenge.</td>', 'I gave you a great score, and I am glad to see somebody put it in the challenge.', '2005-02-09 09:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159378, 143618, 13305, '<td valign="top">Woody is grand.  Interesting lighting.   I think more emotion could be conveyed by a more full length shot.  Without a face, pain is shown  by posture of the figure.</td>', 'Woody is grand.  Interesting lighting.   I think more emotion could be conveyed by a more full length shot.  Without a face, pain is shown  by posture of the figure.', '2005-02-09 09:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159379, 143656, 24073, '<td valign="top">You know what, I had this idea, but didn''t run with it. To my dismay its the only one I have seen in the challege yet.  Regardless, you captured it great better than I could of.  Nice job.</td>', 'You know what, I had this idea, but didn''t run with it. To my dismay its the only one I have seen in the challege yet.  Regardless, you captured it great better than I could of.  Nice job.', '2005-02-09 09:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159380, 144358, 17505, '<td valign="top">Wow, it''s really hard to see the carving. I''m guessing most people won''t take the time to search for the maning, just say ''nothing''s there'' and move on. Good Luck.</td>', 'Wow, it''s really hard to see the carving. I''m guessing most people won''t take the time to search for the maning, just say ''nothing''s there'' and move on. Good Luck.', '2005-02-09 09:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159383, 145171, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice use of irony. Good colors, too.</td>', 'Nice use of irony. Good colors, too.', '2005-02-09 09:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159384, 144938, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very small, catch me on the flipside if you need advice on how to get it bigger I had the same problem.</td>', 'Very small, catch me on the flipside if you need advice on how to get it bigger I had the same problem.', '2005-02-09 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159387, 144894, 13305, '<td valign="top">A picture is worth a 1000 words.   You evidently know a diabetic.  But you failed to include the insulin/syringe that accompanies the testing.  You didn''t include ALL the pain.</td>', 'A picture is worth a 1000 words.   You evidently know a diabetic.  But you failed to include the insulin/syringe that accompanies the testing.  You didn''t include ALL the pain.', '2005-02-09 09:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159394, 144826, 17505, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the face, but I don''t understand what he''s doing. I wider crop might have put more into context. Is the sign supposed to mean something. I feel like I''m missing something obvious...nice portrait, anyhow.</td>', 'Great detail in the face, but I don''t understand what he''s doing. I wider crop might have put more into context. Is the sign supposed to mean something. I feel like I''m missing something obvious...nice portrait, anyhow.', '2005-02-09 09:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159401, 144116, 17505, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Poor little guy''s about to get run over. That''s gotta hurt.</td>', 'Great capture! Poor little guy''s about to get run over. That''s gotta hurt.', '2005-02-09 09:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159402, 145175, 24073, '<td valign="top">Great imagery.  Imaginative, unique, creative, and to me it says pain.  I hope more people see it, good luck.</td>', 'Great imagery.  Imaginative, unique, creative, and to me it says pain.  I hope more people see it, good luck.', '2005-02-09 09:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159403, 144567, 27524, '<td valign="top">No idea what it is...hospital, ship?</td>', 'No idea what it is...hospital, ship?', '2005-02-09 09:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159404, 144795, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) very expressive compozition.</td>', ':) very expressive compozition.', '2005-02-09 09:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159405, 144414, 24073, '<td valign="top">Ouch, nice capturing.</td>', 'Ouch, nice capturing.', '2005-02-09 09:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159412, 143751, 24073, '<td valign="top">I cant get an entire feel for what this photo says to me.  Either pain, or unsolved, at any rate I love the photo.  good job.</td>', 'I cant get an entire feel for what this photo says to me.  Either pain, or unsolved, at any rate I love the photo.  good job.', '2005-02-09 09:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159413, 144152, 24073, '<td valign="top">Hey break out the tequila, normally tequilla means great for me pain for her.  lol, nice mode, i like it.</td>', 'Hey break out the tequila, normally tequilla means great for me pain for her.  lol, nice mode, i like it.', '2005-02-09 09:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159417, 144605, 24073, '<td valign="top">owe good lord, yes indeed that would be painful.</td>', 'owe good lord, yes indeed that would be painful.', '2005-02-09 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159419, 144762, 32315, '<td valign="top">would like to see this image bigger</td>', 'would like to see this image bigger', '2005-02-09 09:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159423, 143983, 32315, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh...nice shot.  I actually like the negative space in this one.</td>', 'Made me laugh...nice shot.  I actually like the negative space in this one.', '2005-02-09 10:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159424, 143173, 32315, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  Good contrast.</td>', 'nice composition.  Good contrast.', '2005-02-09 10:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159430, 144930, 32315, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  Personally I would like to see the foreground in better focus, but very good.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  Personally I would like to see the foreground in better focus, but very good.', '2005-02-09 10:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159434, 143751, 32315, '<td valign="top">looks a little out of focus maybe.  Not sure.</td>', 'looks a little out of focus maybe.  Not sure.', '2005-02-09 10:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159435, 143619, 27839, '<td valign="top">Scary.  I like the photo.</td>', 'Scary.  I like the photo.', '2005-02-09 10:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159451, 145166, 24890, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Good job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-27 00:19:19.</i></td>', 'I really like this one. Good job!', '2005-02-09 10:14:50.000000', '2005-02-27 00:19:19.000000', 1),
(1159461, 144906, 32672, '<td valign="top">Awwww....I''d just love to adopt the little fellow and clean him up.  I love it.  Ten!</td>', 'Awwww....I''d just love to adopt the little fellow and clean him up.  I love it.  Ten!', '2005-02-09 10:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159471, 145061, 24890, '<td valign="top">POWERFUL!!! Best Pain picture I have seen yet! (Hopefully, this was set up... ) Makes the mother in me wanna hug him. 10</td>', 'POWERFUL!!! Best Pain picture I have seen yet! (Hopefully, this was set up... ) Makes the mother in me wanna hug him. 10', '2005-02-09 10:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159473, 145120, 24890, '<td valign="top">OUCH!  :) 9</td>', 'OUCH!  :) 9', '2005-02-09 10:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159474, 144938, 27845, '<td valign="top">Looks rather like a boring lesson. Take larger pictures (max 640 px) Good duotone. 2.</td>', 'Looks rather like a boring lesson. Take larger pictures (max 640 px) Good duotone. 2.', '2005-02-09 10:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159476, 145099, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that everyone''s watching her. The picture would have been better if her face was visible. 4.</td>', 'I like the fact that everyone''s watching her. The picture would have been better if her face was visible. 4.', '2005-02-09 10:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159478, 143425, 24890, '<td valign="top">I had to look twice.  :) Good job on setting this one up. 9</td>', 'I had to look twice.  :) Good job on setting this one up. 9', '2005-02-09 10:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159479, 143392, 32513, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the reflections, nice job on that. This picture has a lot of signal noise in it. I would have lowered the ISO speed and used a slower shutter, but of course, you need a tripod to do this.</td>', 'I like how you captured the reflections, nice job on that. This picture has a lot of signal noise in it. I would have lowered the ISO speed and used a slower shutter, but of course, you need a tripod to do this.', '2005-02-09 10:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159481, 143843, 32513, '<td valign="top">It looks like you used direct flash.</td>', 'It looks like you used direct flash.', '2005-02-09 10:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159483, 145094, 27845, '<td valign="top">I don''t think milk can feel any pain, nor suggest the emotion pain. You did a nice attempt at stopping motion, but your flash creates some harsh shadows and glares on the polished surface. Also, there''s a large empty area in the lower right corner. 3.</td>', 'I don''t think milk can feel any pain, nor suggest the emotion pain. You did a nice attempt at stopping motion, but your flash creates some harsh shadows and glares on the polished surface. Also, there''s a large empty area in the lower right corner. 3.', '2005-02-09 10:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159486, 144737, 32513, '<td valign="top">Oh the pain! Be carefull when photographing white objects, they can easily blow out.</td>', 'Oh the pain! Be carefull when photographing white objects, they can easily blow out.', '2005-02-09 10:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159487, 142828, 27845, '<td valign="top">I can live without them very well :) Your picture is linked to the challenge, but very slightly so. These are painkillers. They do not show pain, nor do they suggest pain to the watcher. Your composition and lighting are not that interesting. Too cunfused, there''s no structure in the image. 4.</td>', 'I can live without them very well :) Your picture is linked to the challenge, but very slightly so. These are painkillers. They do not show pain, nor do they suggest pain to the watcher. Your composition and lighting are not that interesting. Too cunfused, there''s no structure in the image. 4.', '2005-02-09 10:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159490, 145077, 32513, '<td valign="top">This picture looks really blown out. maybe you should have used a black backdrop instead of white. The glove is just so hard to see.</td>', 'This picture looks really blown out. maybe you should have used a black backdrop instead of white. The glove is just so hard to see.', '2005-02-09 10:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159492, 143425, 27845, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge even though it''s a little sick to use a baby doll for this challenge. Your picture is average, not very interesting from the technical point of view. 5.</td>', 'This fits the challenge even though it''s a little sick to use a baby doll for this challenge. Your picture is average, not very interesting from the technical point of view. 5.', '2005-02-09 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159494, 143841, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice lighing, bright colours. Neat and sharp. It suggests pain even though the apple feels none. That''s fine. A higher angle would have suited me better. 7.</td>', 'Nice lighing, bright colours. Neat and sharp. It suggests pain even though the apple feels none. That''s fine. A higher angle would have suited me better. 7.', '2005-02-09 10:31:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1159496, 144938, 32513, '<td valign="top">I think I might have given the child more lead room.</td>', 'I think I might have given the child more lead room.', '2005-02-09 10:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159497, 144913, 24890, '<td valign="top">Powerful! One of few 10s in this challenge.</td>', 'Powerful! One of few 10s in this challenge.', '2005-02-09 10:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159498, 143194, 32672, '<td valign="top">EeeeeK!  My worst fear!  Is that the needle?  Great expression!</td>', 'EeeeeK!  My worst fear!  Is that the needle?  Great expression!', '2005-02-09 10:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159499, 145037, 27845, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look very painful. He''s not injured (at least that''s what it looks like), and nothing in his pose suggests physical pain (I''m sure you''re not referring to emotional pain, are you?). As with many other entries, I think showing the face of your subject would have helped your picture. 4.</td>', 'This doesn''t look very painful. He''s not injured (at least that''s what it looks like), and nothing in his pose suggests physical pain (I''m sure you''re not referring to emotional pain, are you?). As with many other entries, I think showing the face of your subject would have helped your picture. 4.', '2005-02-09 10:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159500, 144906, 31443, '<td valign="top">Poor cat, he''s obviously very ill :(</td>', 'Poor cat, he''s obviously very ill :(', '2005-02-09 10:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159502, 145138, 27845, '<td valign="top">You should have put more emphasis on the scar. It is clear that the facial injury must have been very painful, but the viewer has to search for it. Maybe if your model was touching the scar with the hand it would be easier to see what you''re referring to. 5.</td>', 'You should have put more emphasis on the scar. It is clear that the facial injury must have been very painful, but the viewer has to search for it. Maybe if your model was touching the scar with the hand it would be easier to see what you''re referring to. 5.', '2005-02-09 10:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159503, 145176, 32513, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but I don''t think it was done very well. The color balance seems off, you might have had you''re camera set for 5,600 K and shot under 3,200 K. If this was on puropse, I''m okay with that. Keep trying, this concept can probably put out a powerful image if you put more technical thinking into it.</td>', 'Nice concept, but I don''t think it was done very well. The color balance seems off, you might have had you''re camera set for 5,600 K and shot under 3,200 K. If this was on puropse, I''m okay with that. Keep trying, this concept can probably put out a powerful image if you put more technical thinking into it.', '2005-02-09 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159506, 143425, 27839, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this photo.  I wonder if it is staged or if you found the baby doll stuck like this.</td>', 'I like the feel of this photo.  I wonder if it is staged or if you found the baby doll stuck like this.', '2005-02-09 10:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159508, 144737, 27845, '<td valign="top">A nice interpretation of the challenge. Again, I think that a hand written note would have been better. I don''t think your wife/fiancee would have printed this out for you on a PC. The composition is okay, my eye is drawn around the image and finally focuses on the note. 7.</td>', 'A nice interpretation of the challenge. Again, I think that a hand written note would have been better. I don''t think your wife/fiancee would have printed this out for you on a PC. The composition is okay, my eye is drawn around the image and finally focuses on the note. 7.', '2005-02-09 10:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159510, 144427, 27839, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I would have liked it even more without the hammer.</td>', 'I like this photo.  I would have liked it even more without the hammer.', '2005-02-09 10:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159511, 143244, 27845, '<td valign="top">This suggests emotional pain without having a person in the frame, which is something difficult to achieve. Good jib. The picture''s abit too bright, the contrast is okay. The accessories suggest a child''s death, showing all of the date on the plate would have added to this (it''s just cropped off). 7.</td>', 'This suggests emotional pain without having a person in the frame, which is something difficult to achieve. Good jib. The picture''s abit too bright, the contrast is okay. The accessories suggest a child''s death, showing all of the date on the plate would have added to this (it''s just cropped off). 7.', '2005-02-09 10:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159512, 145122, 24890, '<td valign="top">Haha... Love the title....  9</td>', 'Haha... Love the title....  9', '2005-02-09 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159513, 144800, 24890, '<td valign="top">Love the black and white. Love that it doesn''t feel forced for a picture. Good job 10</td>', 'Love the black and white. Love that it doesn''t feel forced for a picture. Good job 10', '2005-02-09 10:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159515, 143781, 27839, '<td valign="top">Very cute!</td>', 'Very cute!', '2005-02-09 10:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159516, 145108, 31443, '<td valign="top">Meaningful, although painful this lady has dignity...</td>', 'Meaningful, although painful this lady has dignity...', '2005-02-09 10:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159518, 145170, 27845, '<td valign="top">Ouch. I like how the spikes sting your hands and arms (artistically, I''m not sadistic ;)<br/>The white background is very interesting, as most photogs (including me) went for dark, moody shots. Very neat and sharp, good lighting. I''m not sure about the upper part of the picture, above the hands. I think it could have been cropped. 10.</td>', 'Ouch. I like how the spikes sting your hands and arms (artistically, I''m not sadistic ;)The white background is very interesting, as most photogs (including me) went for dark, moody shots. Very neat and sharp, good lighting. I''m not sure about the upper part of the picture, above the hands. I think it could have been cropped. 10.', '2005-02-09 10:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159519, 144898, 24890, '<td valign="top">Powerful! Love this photo! Way to go.... 10</td>', 'Powerful! Love this photo! Way to go.... 10', '2005-02-09 10:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159520, 143193, 24890, '<td valign="top">Nice composition...Nice use of black and white.... Doesn''t feel forced or fake.  10</td>', 'Nice composition...Nice use of black and white.... Doesn''t feel forced or fake.  10', '2005-02-09 10:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159522, 145171, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I like the conflict of the title and the man against the word hope. Nice composition, a bit off-center, tight crop. The legs and arms form a triangle of leading lines that guide me towards the man''s face. 10.</td>', 'This is nice. I like the conflict of the title and the man against the word hope. Nice composition, a bit off-center, tight crop. The legs and arms form a triangle of leading lines that guide me towards the man''s face. 10.', '2005-02-09 10:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159528, 144891, 27845, '<td valign="top">A young, cute animal on a green grass area? This doesn''t suggest pain to me... The DOF is interesting, the foreground is blurred enough not to be disturbing. 4.</td>', 'A young, cute animal on a green grass area? This doesn''t suggest pain to me... The DOF is interesting, the foreground is blurred enough not to be disturbing. 4.', '2005-02-09 10:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159531, 143835, 32513, '<td valign="top">Where did you take this? Must have had to react quick to capture it. Be careful of overexposure when shoting outside on bright days.</td>', 'Where did you take this? Must have had to react quick to capture it. Be careful of overexposure when shoting outside on bright days.', '2005-02-09 10:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159545, 144646, 32513, '<td valign="top">I think your cameras meter was fooled by the statue and cause you''re picture to overexpose.</td>', 'I think your cameras meter was fooled by the statue and cause you''re picture to overexpose.', '2005-02-09 10:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159553, 143902, 32754, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition..the yellow backlight and the almost silhouetted alkaseltzer..it''s a great shot.</td>', 'I really like this composition..the yellow backlight and the almost silhouetted alkaseltzer..it''s a great shot.', '2005-02-09 10:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159556, 145163, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice metering, ouch!</td>', 'Nice metering, ouch!', '2005-02-09 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159557, 145120, 31443, '<td valign="top">hahaha, refreshing and a nice photo</td>', 'hahaha, refreshing and a nice photo', '2005-02-09 10:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159565, 143983, 31443, '<td valign="top">Glad there are some humor in this challenge....love this</td>', 'Glad there are some humor in this challenge....love this', '2005-02-09 11:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159577, 143865, 33366, '<td valign="top">it reminds me of an old short film of dali if i''m not mistaken</td>', 'it reminds me of an old short film of dali if i''m not mistaken', '2005-02-09 11:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159591, 144887, 31443, '<td valign="top">Meaningful, maybe not many people will get the point though....</td>', 'Meaningful, maybe not many people will get the point though....', '2005-02-09 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159614, 145087, 3102, '<td valign="top">Um... YUCK!  I guess that''s all I can think of to say about that!</td>', 'Um... YUCK!  I guess that''s all I can think of to say about that!', '2005-02-09 11:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159627, 145011, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) this is funny...hehe</td>', ':) this is funny...hehe', '2005-02-09 11:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159637, 144906, 27524, '<td valign="top">Strong picture... nice done in sepia.</td>', 'Strong picture... nice done in sepia.', '2005-02-09 11:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159640, 145171, 27524, '<td valign="top">Strong emotional... nice colors.</td>', 'Strong emotional... nice colors.', '2005-02-09 11:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159641, 145138, 6576, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but it would have been so much better in black &amp; white</td>', 'I like this photo but it would have been so much better in black & white', '2005-02-09 11:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159645, 145010, 3102, '<td valign="top">I think the worse problem this person has is the fact that he''s bleeding ketchup!</td>', 'I think the worse problem this person has is the fact that he''s bleeding ketchup!', '2005-02-09 11:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159652, 144567, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I just don''t get it... :/</td>', 'I''m afraid I just don''t get it... :/', '2005-02-09 11:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159666, 144626, 30342, '<td valign="top">Weird picture and I don''t really get it but I did score it higher just for the uniqueness. 7</td>', 'Weird picture and I don''t really get it but I did score it higher just for the uniqueness. 7', '2005-02-09 12:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159671, 145167, 32513, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect with the depth of field.</td>', 'Very nice effect with the depth of field.', '2005-02-09 12:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159673, 144625, 32513, '<td valign="top">Direct flash is killing this picture, and blowing out portions of his skin. Try more diffusion if you really want to go with a direct flash.</td>', 'Direct flash is killing this picture, and blowing out portions of his skin. Try more diffusion if you really want to go with a direct flash.', '2005-02-09 12:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
