(1159786, 145170, 31213, '<td valign="top">A little uninspired...by this I mean....whats the meaning?  Sometimes on a confusing image the title can help the viewer make sense of it...but you didn''t even give us that   Still a pleasant image thats composed, exposed and creatively shot.  I like how the arms are interwoven witht he wire and not just on one side of it.  Adds a nice 3D feel.</td>', 'A little uninspired...by this I mean....whats the meaning?  Sometimes on a confusing image the title can help the viewer make sense of it...but you didn''t even give us that   Still a pleasant image thats composed, exposed and creatively shot.  I like how the arms are interwoven witht he wire and not just on one side of it.  Adds a nice 3D feel.', '2005-02-09 13:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159792, 145087, 31213, '<td valign="top">No words....This is not tastefull in the least.  I expect challenges to be taken with not only a creative approach (as you did) but a tasteful one as well.  <br/> <br/>Here is what this is equivalent to.....If the challenge was "Nudes" and you entered a porn set shot of some girl getting doubled teamed by two guys.  Its just not right in this challenge.  I realize you used a white background and probably put some time into it, but you have to realize whats in good taste and whats not.</td>', 'No words....This is not tastefull in the least.  I expect challenges to be taken with not only a creative approach (as you did) but a tasteful one as well.   Here is what this is equivalent to.....If the challenge was "Nudes" and you entered a porn set shot of some girl getting doubled teamed by two guys.  Its just not right in this challenge.  I realize you used a white background and probably put some time into it, but you have to realize whats in good taste and whats not.', '2005-02-09 13:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159794, 143781, 31213, '<td valign="top">Hilarious shot!  It doens''t scream pain at me...but it is pretty funny.  My emotional reaction when I first glance at this is  funny, then a little sad for the dog for having to wear one of those!  Pain doesn''t necessarily strike me from this image.  Fun shot though regardless.</td>', 'Hilarious shot!  It doens''t scream pain at me...but it is pretty funny.  My emotional reaction when I first glance at this is  funny, then a little sad for the dog for having to wear one of those!  Pain doesn''t necessarily strike me from this image.  Fun shot though regardless.', '2005-02-09 13:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159795, 145087, 30853, '<td valign="top">Too morbid for me</td>', 'Too morbid for me', '2005-02-09 13:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159801, 144800, 31213, '<td valign="top">I think with a different expression on her face this would have felt a little more painful.  Aside from the running makeup and teardrop on her face, I''m not feelign the pain.  I''m not saying that it wouldnt be possible to do....I would ahve taken about 100 shots of her and had her think of sad things.  Maybe even tell a sad story and then snap away as she talks.  I may be more emotional if she wasn''t so square with the camera.  The lighting is nice.  She just looks a little posed, as if it was like "Okay let me fix this makeup, ok now hold that pose....rdy???"  The expression will be the cause of at least a whole point for you in this challenge I bet.</td>', 'I think with a different expression on her face this would have felt a little more painful.  Aside from the running makeup and teardrop on her face, I''m not feelign the pain.  I''m not saying that it wouldnt be possible to do....I would ahve taken about 100 shots of her and had her think of sad things.  Maybe even tell a sad story and then snap away as she talks.  I may be more emotional if she wasn''t so square with the camera.  The lighting is nice.  She just looks a little posed, as if it was like "Okay let me fix this makeup, ok now hold that pose....rdy???"  The expression will be the cause of at least a whole point for you in this challenge I bet.', '2005-02-09 13:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
