(1159833, 144971, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the shot.  I actually am one of the few people who appreciates soft focus sometimes.  In my opinion things don''t always have to be in crystal clear focus to achieve the artistic style that you were going for.<br/> <br/>My biggest problem is that the tear is the only thing representing pain in the babies face.  The facial expression is very content and pleasant looking.  If he looked more sad, hurt, or emotional in anyway it would be a bit more powerful.  Love the fingers on the face though.  Very nice image.  Keep up the great work! :))</td>', 'Love the shot.  I actually am one of the few people who appreciates soft focus sometimes.  In my opinion things don''t always have to be in crystal clear focus to achieve the artistic style that you were going for. My biggest problem is that the tear is the only thing representing pain in the babies face.  The facial expression is very content and pleasant looking.  If he looked more sad, hurt, or emotional in anyway it would be a bit more powerful.  Love the fingers on the face though.  Very nice image.  Keep up the great work! :))', '2005-02-09 14:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
