(1159941, 145076, 32513, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea and a good start, I think it would be about 10 times more effective if you had the wall further away and a shadow of the person stretching across the floor. My reason for this is because it could just be considered as someone falling off a stool and not suicide, with the shadow of the persons full body and a rope going up to a rafter from their neck, well, there simply isn''t any confusion.</td>', 'This is an excellent idea and a good start, I think it would be about 10 times more effective if you had the wall further away and a shadow of the person stretching across the floor. My reason for this is because it could just be considered as someone falling off a stool and not suicide, with the shadow of the persons full body and a rope going up to a rafter from their neck, well, there simply isn''t any confusion.', '2005-02-09 14:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
