(1160263, 144576, 31742, '<td valign="top">OK where do i start ......i really need to comment on your picture i didn''t want to be to harsh on you  but i need to tell you what i feel about your picture .. please do not get offended. .. ... who in their right state of mind would have the time and the heart to take this picture during a Wake / Funeral. how could you have the guts to take a picture of a dead person (R.I.P) with all loves ones around mourning .. Sorry but this Picture is horrible. that just my opinion. If you knew this person sorry for the loss of your loved one. maybe in your culture you can take pictures at a wake and it''s OK with every one but for me I don''t like to remember my loved ones on the worse day ever ....</td>', 'OK where do i start ......i really need to comment on your picture i didn''t want to be to harsh on you  but i need to tell you what i feel about your picture .. please do not get offended. .. ... who in their right state of mind would have the time and the heart to take this picture during a Wake / Funeral. how could you have the guts to take a picture of a dead person (R.I.P) with all loves ones around mourning .. Sorry but this Picture is horrible. that just my opinion. If you knew this person sorry for the loss of your loved one. maybe in your culture you can take pictures at a wake and it''s OK with every one but for me I don''t like to remember my loved ones on the worse day ever ....', '2005-02-09 16:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
