(1160306, 144389, 6845, '<td valign="top">Man oh man this is a great shot. The lighting is spot on. The look in his eyes is so distant and haunting. I do not know why he would do this other than something took over his body in a horror flick or something. But that aside, i must say i really enjoy this image and I hope it is not scoring too low do to the content. The blood also seems a bit dry for being a fresh cut, but of course if you would have been more realistic with it, i am guessing it would score lower. Any way good luck, and if this is a style to your work, keep it up.</td>', 'Man oh man this is a great shot. The lighting is spot on. The look in his eyes is so distant and haunting. I do not know why he would do this other than something took over his body in a horror flick or something. But that aside, i must say i really enjoy this image and I hope it is not scoring too low do to the content. The blood also seems a bit dry for being a fresh cut, but of course if you would have been more realistic with it, i am guessing it would score lower. Any way good luck, and if this is a style to your work, keep it up.', '2005-02-09 17:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160321, 144389, 28061, '<td valign="top">nice picture<br/></td>', 'nice picture', '2005-02-09 17:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160338, 145178, 31541, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think it might have been better if you showed someone''s finger getting pricked (to emphasize the pain part).   The shot is really clear, although I''d like a lighter background.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think it might have been better if you showed someone''s finger getting pricked (to emphasize the pain part).   The shot is really clear, although I''d like a lighter background.', '2005-02-09 17:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160342, 145120, 31541, '<td valign="top">This is pretty funny.  The floor and outlets on the wall distract from the picture though.</td>', 'This is pretty funny.  The floor and outlets on the wall distract from the picture though.', '2005-02-09 17:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160343, 143084, 31541, '<td valign="top">This picture is too washed out for my tastes.  What happened to that poor kid?</td>', 'This picture is too washed out for my tastes.  What happened to that poor kid?', '2005-02-09 17:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160345, 144625, 31541, '<td valign="top">I had to look up the title (didn'' t know that word!).  The picture is nicely framed and sharp, but the main focus of the person being in pain isn''t emphasized enough.  I''m not sure how to remedy this though (sorry).</td>', 'I had to look up the title (didn'' t know that word!).  The picture is nicely framed and sharp, but the main focus of the person being in pain isn''t emphasized enough.  I''m not sure how to remedy this though (sorry).', '2005-02-09 17:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160346, 144584, 32792, '<td valign="top">Scenario gives a better "feel" for the rest of the image.<br/>The shadows look a bit awkward.</td>', 'Scenario gives a better "feel" for the rest of the image.The shadows look a bit awkward.', '2005-02-09 17:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160350, 145071, 31541, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I think it might have more impact if you could see more anguish from the person who found the suicide.  The red is a little too much in the shadows for my tastes.</td>', 'I like the idea.  I think it might have more impact if you could see more anguish from the person who found the suicide.  The red is a little too much in the shadows for my tastes.', '2005-02-09 17:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160352, 142815, 31541, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color.  The photo is a little washed out, so it''s hard to see the tear.  I wouldn''t have noticed if it wasn''t in the title.  Also, her mouth almost looks as if it''s about to smile rather than being in pain.</td>', 'Interesting use of color.  The photo is a little washed out, so it''s hard to see the tear.  I wouldn''t have noticed if it wasn''t in the title.  Also, her mouth almost looks as if it''s about to smile rather than being in pain.', '2005-02-09 17:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160354, 143619, 31541, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but the line in the top left corner is distracting.  Without it, the focus would have been only on the gun..much better impact.</td>', 'I like this shot, but the line in the top left corner is distracting.  Without it, the focus would have been only on the gun..much better impact.', '2005-02-09 17:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160360, 143656, 31541, '<td valign="top">I was recuctant to touch this one (pun intended)...Pretty funny.  The glare on the bandaid is a little distracting.</td>', 'I was recuctant to touch this one (pun intended)...Pretty funny.  The glare on the bandaid is a little distracting.', '2005-02-09 17:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
