(1160376, 144389, 31541, '<td valign="top">There is something about this picture I really like, although I can'' t pinpoint it.  Maybe it''s the expression on the subjects face.  Why anyone would do this, I don''t know - but it does lend itself to a big creepy factor.</td>', 'There is something about this picture I really like, although I can'' t pinpoint it.  Maybe it''s the expression on the subjects face.  Why anyone would do this, I don''t know - but it does lend itself to a big creepy factor.', '2005-02-09 17:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
