(1160893, 144860, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love the idea behind this, and the setup itself is not bad.  From a purely aesthetic POV however, to make this as racy as possible, I think the lady''s foot could have used a good pedicure and possibly some lotion, and maybe even a shave on the lower leg...those little details might be the difference in a point or two on the score.   Technically, the image is OK but the shadow is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I love the idea behind this, and the setup itself is not bad.  From a purely aesthetic POV however, to make this as racy as possible, I think the lady''s foot could have used a good pedicure and possibly some lotion, and maybe even a shave on the lower leg...those little details might be the difference in a point or two on the score.   Technically, the image is OK but the shadow is a bit distracting.', '2005-02-09 21:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
