(1161164, 145168, 8624, '<td valign="top">good idea and interesting composition. her expression doesn''t really look pained to me though. she seems almost content, which I''m sure is not the emotion you were trying to convey</td>', 'good idea and interesting composition. her expression doesn''t really look pained to me though. she seems almost content, which I''m sure is not the emotion you were trying to convey', '2005-02-10 01:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161167, 145120, 8624, '<td valign="top">fun idea. I think a simpler shirt and foor design would better draw attention to the flattened face, though.</td>', 'fun idea. I think a simpler shirt and foor design would better draw attention to the flattened face, though.', '2005-02-10 01:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161168, 143843, 28742, '<td valign="top">Quote: [No animals were harmed in making this picture]<br/>Too bad. I''d have given you extra points!  ;-)</td>', 'Quote: [No animals were harmed in making this picture]Too bad. I''d have given you extra points!  ;-)', '2005-02-10 01:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161170, 144857, 28742, '<td valign="top">Should''ve had eye closed. This looks more like anger or bitterness. Otherwise, nice ly framed &amp; cropped.</td>', 'Should''ve had eye closed. This looks more like anger or bitterness. Otherwise, nice ly framed & cropped.', '2005-02-10 01:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161171, 143656, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''ll go wash out me eyes now.</td>', 'I''ll go wash out me eyes now.', '2005-02-10 01:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161172, 145029, 28742, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like he''s in any pain anymore. I''d ask if this is real, but I''m afraid of the answer.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like he''s in any pain anymore. I''d ask if this is real, but I''m afraid of the answer.', '2005-02-10 01:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161173, 145067, 28742, '<td valign="top">Suggest more fiber!  ;-)</td>', 'Suggest more fiber!  ;-)', '2005-02-10 01:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161176, 145119, 28742, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling! When you wake your kid up at the crack of dawn to go out and learn to ride the bike and they just can''t stay awake. Very frustrating!  ;-)</td>', 'I know the feeling! When you wake your kid up at the crack of dawn to go out and learn to ride the bike and they just can''t stay awake. Very frustrating!  ;-)', '2005-02-10 01:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161245, 144892, 28108, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. Personaly, I would''ve gave it more negative space. Rule of third, apple in the lower right intersection. But I love the tones and the grainyness...</td>', 'I love this picture. Personaly, I would''ve gave it more negative space. Rule of third, apple in the lower right intersection. But I love the tones and the grainyness...', '2005-02-10 03:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161252, 143466, 28108, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool... It''s very daring. It''s too bad we can see the putty lines but that was neat idea. Maybe with a differant lighting, you could''ve have hidden them.</td>', 'That''s pretty cool... It''s very daring. It''s too bad we can see the putty lines but that was neat idea. Maybe with a differant lighting, you could''ve have hidden them.', '2005-02-10 03:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161259, 144800, 28108, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones. The relation between the model and the camera is very intimate. Nothing''s over done. That''s really nice to look at and hard to look away.</td>', 'Beautiful tones. The relation between the model and the camera is very intimate. Nothing''s over done. That''s really nice to look at and hard to look away.', '2005-02-10 03:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161327, 143618, 14863, '<td valign="top">Yay for the woody doll- great photo, great tones and everything- perfect 10</td>', 'Yay for the woody doll- great photo, great tones and everything- perfect 10', '2005-02-10 04:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
