(1161405, 143653, 32790, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, its dark though. What grabs me about it is that it shows insecurity, i dont know if that was the message you were trying to get across, but thats what it does to me..</td>', 'I like this photo, its dark though. What grabs me about it is that it shows insecurity, i dont know if that was the message you were trying to get across, but thats what it does to me..', '2005-02-10 08:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
