(1161420, 144905, 32790, '<td valign="top">Good message, great title for it as well. The empty space above the statue works very well and gives it an even deeper meaning.</td>', 'Good message, great title for it as well. The empty space above the statue works very well and gives it an even deeper meaning.', '2005-02-10 08:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161421, 145009, 32790, '<td valign="top">This one is sad! You can clearly see the pain in this one, and the somewhat stunned look of the kid works well in that case.</td>', 'This one is sad! You can clearly see the pain in this one, and the somewhat stunned look of the kid works well in that case.', '2005-02-10 08:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161423, 145174, 32790, '<td valign="top">Good focus! Im not at that point in my life where i would have to sign these, and i hope i will never have to, but i can imagine that being painful. Lighting looks very good as well.</td>', 'Good focus! Im not at that point in my life where i would have to sign these, and i hope i will never have to, but i can imagine that being painful. Lighting looks very good as well.', '2005-02-10 08:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161425, 145029, 32790, '<td valign="top">Very well set-up. Blood looks real, and i like the fact that you can only see some of the model in the mirror. Colors and lighting all look good!</td>', 'Very well set-up. Blood looks real, and i like the fact that you can only see some of the model in the mirror. Colors and lighting all look good!', '2005-02-10 08:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161426, 143193, 32790, '<td valign="top">Awesome focus, and great lighting. I have the feeling actual pain is being shown here. Powerful photo.</td>', 'Awesome focus, and great lighting. I have the feeling actual pain is being shown here. Powerful photo.', '2005-02-10 08:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161431, 143173, 32790, '<td valign="top">Wow seeing this one really gave me that feeling.. The feeling of that each one of these stones is one person leaving maybe tens, maybe hundreds behind that really cared for him or her. And i truly believe they did die for a reason, for us, so that we could be free to be who we are. Powerful photo, good lighting, awesome angle.</td>', 'Wow seeing this one really gave me that feeling.. The feeling of that each one of these stones is one person leaving maybe tens, maybe hundreds behind that really cared for him or her. And i truly believe they did die for a reason, for us, so that we could be free to be who we are. Powerful photo, good lighting, awesome angle.', '2005-02-10 08:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161438, 144893, 32790, '<td valign="top">Great split-second capture, good colors, and good focus!</td>', 'Great split-second capture, good colors, and good focus!', '2005-02-10 08:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161451, 144228, 8759, '<td valign="top">Pretty good composition and good use of black and white. I am a NeatImage fan but we have to take care wiith these noise reducing software. The hair of your model looks weird. I think a little of grain would have enhanced the photo.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Pretty good composition and good use of black and white. I am a NeatImage fan but we have to take care wiith these noise reducing software. The hair of your model looks weird. I think a little of grain would have enhanced the photo.Good luck', '2005-02-10 08:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161454, 143742, 8759, '<td valign="top">Flash too srong. Good strong image, well composed... only the flash Good luck</td>', 'Flash too srong. Good strong image, well composed... only the flash Good luck', '2005-02-10 08:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1161457, 144286, 8759, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Works for me. a little more contrast would be nice</td>', 'Ouch! Works for me. a little more contrast would be nice', '2005-02-10 08:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
