(1161773, 144893, 8284, '<td valign="top">Perfect title.  Great shot.  The kid''s face is in perfect focus, while the sled is not.  There''s color reflected in the flying snow &amp; in the shadow on the ground.  I suspect some will complain about the bit of black in the top left corner, but I think it''s necessary to show the angle of the hill.  You included just enough to do that.  Beautiful.  One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Perfect title.  Great shot.  The kid''s face is in perfect focus, while the sled is not.  There''s color reflected in the flying snow & in the shadow on the ground.  I suspect some will complain about the bit of black in the top left corner, but I think it''s necessary to show the angle of the hill.  You included just enough to do that.  Beautiful.  One of the best in the challenge.', '2005-02-10 14:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
