(1162429, 145122, 30576, '<td valign="top">may be fake and may not, but a bit too graphic for me...good title though. Seems a bit unbalanced, maybe shifting the subject up would help.</td>', 'may be fake and may not, but a bit too graphic for me...good title though. Seems a bit unbalanced, maybe shifting the subject up would help.', '2005-02-10 20:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
