(1163198, 145087, 17505, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s obvious you put some work into this photo, and it''s funny, but...<br/>...I don''t think it''s a very good photograph overall. The background cloths are wrinkled and the cat''s not bleeding. I would have cropped the back of the cat off so that we couldn''t see that the tail was already gone. Although that wouldn''t be funny because then we wouldn''t no that it didn''t have a tail...hmmm...I''m really not sure how to make this phot work, but it was worth a shot, eh?</td>', 'Well, it''s obvious you put some work into this photo, and it''s funny, but......I don''t think it''s a very good photograph overall. The background cloths are wrinkled and the cat''s not bleeding. I would have cropped the back of the cat off so that we couldn''t see that the tail was already gone. Although that wouldn''t be funny because then we wouldn''t no that it didn''t have a tail...hmmm...I''m really not sure how to make this phot work, but it was worth a shot, eh?', '2005-02-11 08:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1163244, 144980, 31403, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo, not sure if it really fits, but it''s a nice break from the other entries</td>', 'beautiful photo, not sure if it really fits, but it''s a nice break from the other entries', '2005-02-11 09:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1163246, 145144, 23141, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  It looks as though you used a bit too much neatimage, but I like the emotions and the compassion you''ve captured here.</td>', 'I really like this picture.  It looks as though you used a bit too much neatimage, but I like the emotions and the compassion you''ve captured here.', '2005-02-11 09:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1163247, 144411, 31403, '<td valign="top">barb wire is a great idea for pain, but this is a photo of a field and a forest to me.  Even shooting the same fence against the sky would make it better, more focused on your subject.</td>', 'barb wire is a great idea for pain, but this is a photo of a field and a forest to me.  Even shooting the same fence against the sky would make it better, more focused on your subject.', '2005-02-11 09:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1163252, 144947, 31403, '<td valign="top">a powerful image and subject to invoke.  Well shot too.  I love the grain.  I think we need more grain on DPC and I appreciate you using it so well here</td>', 'a powerful image and subject to invoke.  Well shot too.  I love the grain.  I think we need more grain on DPC and I appreciate you using it so well here', '2005-02-11 09:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1163254, 144967, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is a great image, as far as the apple goes.  The dark liquid is too easy, too "in your face".  The apple makes me think, but the liquid makes me want to move on</td>', 'this is a great image, as far as the apple goes.  The dark liquid is too easy, too "in your face".  The apple makes me think, but the liquid makes me want to move on', '2005-02-11 09:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
