(1163290, 143619, 29858, '<td valign="top">The composition throws me off.  The bottom arm looks disembodied, and while I understand where you''re trying to go with the high contrast, I think you took it a step to far.  Keep trying though.</td>', 'The composition throws me off.  The bottom arm looks disembodied, and while I understand where you''re trying to go with the high contrast, I think you took it a step to far.  Keep trying though.', '2005-02-11 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
