(1163294, 144855, 29858, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with this, but without the title you don''t know where this is going.</td>', 'I see where you were going with this, but without the title you don''t know where this is going.', '2005-02-11 10:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1163296, 145165, 29858, '<td valign="top">Being sort of a newb around here I''m not even sure this fits into the "Basic Editing" catagory (Would appreciate if someone would let me know)  Other than that, I''m still not a fan of this pic.  1) Too much noise.  2) Odd Hue and Saturation levels are distracting and 3) Nothing seems to be in focus.</td>', 'Being sort of a newb around here I''m not even sure this fits into the "Basic Editing" catagory (Would appreciate if someone would let me know)  Other than that, I''m still not a fan of this pic.  1) Too much noise.  2) Odd Hue and Saturation levels are distracting and 3) Nothing seems to be in focus.', '2005-02-11 10:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
