(1163324, 144968, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a very emotional photograph for me.   I am mentoring a young girl who I have really grown to love, who struggles with this cutting herself thing.     My heart breaks for what she goes through.   I like the photograph alot.  It gives voice to the deep, deep pain that is a real problem in some really awesome people''s lives.</td>', 'This is a very emotional photograph for me.   I am mentoring a young girl who I have really grown to love, who struggles with this cutting herself thing.     My heart breaks for what she goes through.   I like the photograph alot.  It gives voice to the deep, deep pain that is a real problem in some really awesome people''s lives.', '2005-02-11 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
