(1163390, 143339, 24454, '<td valign="top">Your model did a great job depicting pain.    You can really see it on his face.    I think my personal tastes would like the picture better if it wasn''t in quite such a low light situation, but maybe the darkness was part of the intent for the theme.   It''s just hard to get a really sharp picture in such low light.   I like it though.</td>', 'Your model did a great job depicting pain.    You can really see it on his face.    I think my personal tastes would like the picture better if it wasn''t in quite such a low light situation, but maybe the darkness was part of the intent for the theme.   It''s just hard to get a really sharp picture in such low light.   I like it though.', '2005-02-11 10:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1163392, 144427, 29858, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Just a little too much noise, and a little over sharp.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Just a little too much noise, and a little over sharp.', '2005-02-11 10:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
