(1163554, 145005, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah.. ..been there, had that pain.   And she really conveys it well.    Nice picture.  Sharp, good contrast and lighting, and the composition and background are good.</td>', 'Oh yeah.. ..been there, had that pain.   And she really conveys it well.    Nice picture.  Sharp, good contrast and lighting, and the composition and background are good.', '2005-02-11 12:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
