(1163591, 144448, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such a sad picture!   There''s such a "realness" to it, and that kind of pain goes deep!   The picture is nicely done.   It''s sharp and the contrast and lighting is good.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is such a sad picture!   There''s such a "realness" to it, and that kind of pain goes deep!   The picture is nicely done.   It''s sharp and the contrast and lighting is good.  Good luck!', '2005-02-11 13:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
