(1163595, 143244, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness.   There are several photos depicting the pain of a loss through death, but this one brought tears to my eyes the instant I saw it.    Your title adds to the emotion of the photograph.  The photo is nicely composed.  I  like your cepia tones, and the stone is beautiful.   I think there is a little too much contrast / brightness, but the emotion and composition of the photo makes up for it.    Good luck.</td>', 'Ohmygoodness.   There are several photos depicting the pain of a loss through death, but this one brought tears to my eyes the instant I saw it.    Your title adds to the emotion of the photograph.  The photo is nicely composed.  I  like your cepia tones, and the stone is beautiful.   I think there is a little too much contrast / brightness, but the emotion and composition of the photo makes up for it.    Good luck.', '2005-02-11 13:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1163598, 144116, 24454, '<td valign="top">At first I thought. . . hmmmmm. . . .they sure do look like they are having fun, but then I saw the look on the face of the little one on the ground and it made sense.   It''s an awesome photo, and I probaby would have given it a really high score anyway, because I think there''s way too much analism on the "doesn''t meet the challenge" thing anyway!   This is great.   The colors really stand out against the snow, and it''s nice and sharp.  Good luck!</td>', 'At first I thought. . . hmmmmm. . . .they sure do look like they are having fun, but then I saw the look on the face of the little one on the ground and it made sense.   It''s an awesome photo, and I probaby would have given it a really high score anyway, because I think there''s way too much analism on the "doesn''t meet the challenge" thing anyway!   This is great.   The colors really stand out against the snow, and it''s nice and sharp.  Good luck!', '2005-02-11 13:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
