(1164717, 144860, 32464, '<td valign="top">you can say that again ... someone turn up  the air conditioning...its getting warm.</td>', 'you can say that again ... someone turn up  the air conditioning...its getting warm.', '2005-02-12 03:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164723, 144795, 32464, '<td valign="top">oh man...it makes me wanna laugh but i can feel the pain at the same time..very creative!</td>', 'oh man...it makes me wanna laugh but i can feel the pain at the same time..very creative!', '2005-02-12 03:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164730, 145170, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and thought provoking. Excellent. My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Very dramatic and thought provoking. Excellent. My favorite of the challenge.', '2005-02-12 03:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164736, 144731, 31443, '<td valign="top">There is something about somber expressions on angels in graveyards...wish there was a little more of the surroundings in this photo because the wing on the left fills up too much space...</td>', 'There is something about somber expressions on angels in graveyards...wish there was a little more of the surroundings in this photo because the wing on the left fills up too much space...', '2005-02-12 03:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164756, 144063, 30364, '<td valign="top">Of the tiny handfull of images in this challenge that genuinely examine pain as an emotion, rather than just a sensation, this is clearly the best.  Loss, grief, bewilderment and deep, unreachable pain. A very strong, unequivocal photograph, even without the heart-wrenching title.  10.</td>', 'Of the tiny handfull of images in this challenge that genuinely examine pain as an emotion, rather than just a sensation, this is clearly the best.  Loss, grief, bewilderment and deep, unreachable pain. A very strong, unequivocal photograph, even without the heart-wrenching title.  10.', '2005-02-12 04:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164757, 145061, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very good take on Pain; so much more thoughtful than nails in fruit, or Tylenol.  It''s well composed and well executed; a totally convincing image.  9.</td>', 'This is a very good take on Pain; so much more thoughtful than nails in fruit, or Tylenol.  It''s well composed and well executed; a totally convincing image.  9.', '2005-02-12 05:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164759, 145005, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very competent image; well conceived, lit and executed.  Very convincing, too; she looks exactly like she''s suffering a monster headache.  8.</td>', 'A very competent image; well conceived, lit and executed.  Very convincing, too; she looks exactly like she''s suffering a monster headache.  8.', '2005-02-12 05:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164780, 145030, 32345, '<td valign="top">Beautifull, hopefully this will bring you a ribbon.</td>', 'Beautifull, hopefully this will bring you a ribbon.', '2005-02-12 06:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164784, 145061, 12571, '<td valign="top">This one really struck a chord with me. Excellent job. Love the out of focus background. I favour this one for a blue.</td>', 'This one really struck a chord with me. Excellent job. Love the out of focus background. I favour this one for a blue.', '2005-02-12 07:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164791, 144848, 27839, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection in the knife!</td>', 'Love the reflection in the knife!', '2005-02-12 07:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164792, 143527, 27839, '<td valign="top">Different take on the challenge.  I really like it.</td>', 'Different take on the challenge.  I really like it.', '2005-02-12 07:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164795, 144576, 3306, '<td valign="top">A very sad and touching picture. The pain is obvious.</td>', 'A very sad and touching picture. The pain is obvious.', '2005-02-12 07:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164797, 145076, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have done a very good job of portraying the ultimate Pain without being graphic. Although I find this picture very disturbing it is extremely well done and I would have to say one of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'You have done a very good job of portraying the ultimate Pain without being graphic. Although I find this picture very disturbing it is extremely well done and I would have to say one of the best of the challenge.', '2005-02-12 07:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164852, 144643, 31443, '<td valign="top">Looks like a young dog to me :) and I''m sure he''s as sweet as can be....nice closeup....</td>', 'Looks like a young dog to me :) and I''m sure he''s as sweet as can be....nice closeup....', '2005-02-12 08:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164861, 144063, 31443, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most meaningful entries sofar...some may say it''s staged but a mother''s loss is a constant pain and it only takes so little to produce those tears, healing is long and slow, only consolation are the good moments with that loved one that has passed.....please give this mother a warm hug from me, a dear friend is in the exact same situation and I try my best to be there for her and listen... all good wishes from Gurry</td>', 'This is one of the most meaningful entries sofar...some may say it''s staged but a mother''s loss is a constant pain and it only takes so little to produce those tears, healing is long and slow, only consolation are the good moments with that loved one that has passed.....please give this mother a warm hug from me, a dear friend is in the exact same situation and I try my best to be there for her and listen... all good wishes from Gurry', '2005-02-12 09:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164862, 145144, 31443, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, that''s painful alright</td>', 'Oh yes, that''s painful alright', '2005-02-12 09:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164867, 144849, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I''m sure though it could have been a lot clearer...</td>', 'Nice composition, I''m sure though it could have been a lot clearer...', '2005-02-12 09:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164869, 144913, 31443, '<td valign="top">Humiliation and pain....</td>', 'Humiliation and pain....', '2005-02-12 09:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164870, 145094, 31443, '<td valign="top">nice composition rather funny title.....milk feels pain??? Will we ever know :)</td>', 'nice composition rather funny title.....milk feels pain??? Will we ever know :)', '2005-02-12 09:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164873, 143865, 31443, '<td valign="top">Oh my God....what were you thinking, hope someone didn''t get hurt.....! wish you had used something other than razor blade....could have been a better composition</td>', 'Oh my God....what were you thinking, hope someone didn''t get hurt.....! wish you had used something other than razor blade....could have been a better composition', '2005-02-12 09:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164875, 144962, 31443, '<td valign="top">And that''s painful! Awww I remember those tumbles, what 10 times a day or more...good thing to have someone nearby for comfort...</td>', 'And that''s painful! Awww I remember those tumbles, what 10 times a day or more...good thing to have someone nearby for comfort...', '2005-02-12 09:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164877, 143618, 31443, '<td valign="top">Pity about the blur....nice expression though</td>', 'Pity about the blur....nice expression though', '2005-02-12 09:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164885, 143843, 31443, '<td valign="top">Good shot....knowing cats very well I would say this was a delightful yawn :) purrs and scritches to this beautiful model...</td>', 'Good shot....knowing cats very well I would say this was a delightful yawn :) purrs and scritches to this beautiful model...', '2005-02-12 09:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164887, 144152, 31443, '<td valign="top">You are probably going to get low marks for this otherwise good composition...too dark, too small , it''s good to use most of the allowed pixels of up to 640 across and too dark..</td>', 'You are probably going to get low marks for this otherwise good composition...too dark, too small , it''s good to use most of the allowed pixels of up to 640 across and too dark..', '2005-02-12 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164890, 144605, 31443, '<td valign="top">Painful! Yes indeed....image a bit blurred on upper half, would have been nicer with better focus</td>', 'Painful! Yes indeed....image a bit blurred on upper half, would have been nicer with better focus', '2005-02-12 09:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164893, 144893, 31443, '<td valign="top">But they won''t admit it because it''s so much fun :)</td>', 'But they won''t admit it because it''s so much fun :)', '2005-02-12 09:44:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1164896, 144789, 17505, '<td valign="top">Too close and out of focus. This looks like a doll rather than a real child, I think that''s due to all the noise and maybe because it''s in black and white.</td>', 'Too close and out of focus. This looks like a doll rather than a real child, I think that''s due to all the noise and maybe because it''s in black and white.', '2005-02-12 09:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164902, 143656, 17505, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s got homor going for it...<br/>Too contrasty for my tastes and it''s out of focus. <br/>I do like the sepia tones.</td>', 'Well, it''s got homor going for it...Too contrasty for my tastes and it''s out of focus. I do like the sepia tones.', '2005-02-12 09:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164927, 145147, 31524, '<td valign="top">been there! Great for this contest</td>', 'been there! Great for this contest', '2005-02-12 10:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164928, 144389, 31524, '<td valign="top">hope this was set up!</td>', 'hope this was set up!', '2005-02-12 10:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164929, 143742, 31524, '<td valign="top">what emotion this draws up.  Great.</td>', 'what emotion this draws up.  Great.', '2005-02-12 10:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164934, 143490, 31524, '<td valign="top">great, doesn''t look faked.</td>', 'great, doesn''t look faked.', '2005-02-12 10:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164937, 144546, 31524, '<td valign="top">so typical of teen today.</td>', 'so typical of teen today.', '2005-02-12 10:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164939, 144945, 31524, '<td valign="top">good shot, but looks a little staged.</td>', 'good shot, but looks a little staged.', '2005-02-12 10:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164942, 145173, 31524, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2005-02-12 10:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164943, 145063, 31524, '<td valign="top">have watched this, is great pain.</td>', 'have watched this, is great pain.', '2005-02-12 10:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164945, 144848, 31524, '<td valign="top">self infilcted pain is never entertaining at all.  gross.</td>', 'self infilcted pain is never entertaining at all.  gross.', '2005-02-12 10:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164957, 144414, 27847, '<td valign="top">Great Job on this one, it''s very sharp and excellent on the DOF with enough details to see the facial reaction. Good work.</td>', 'Great Job on this one, it''s very sharp and excellent on the DOF with enough details to see the facial reaction. Good work.', '2005-02-12 11:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164958, 144116, 27847, '<td valign="top">Ouch, great photo. I''m also impressed that the snow wasn''t washed out (over exposed in this photo). Superb timing.</td>', 'Ouch, great photo. I''m also impressed that the snow wasn''t washed out (over exposed in this photo). Superb timing.', '2005-02-12 11:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164960, 144962, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the child''s face. It clearly shows pain. Unfortunately, this picture has a ''snapshot'' look to it: It''s a bit unsharp and the lighting is uninteresting. If you have the possibility, try to include all of the head inside the frame, and crop off some of the jumper. 4.</td>', 'I like the expression on the child''s face. It clearly shows pain. Unfortunately, this picture has a ''snapshot'' look to it: It''s a bit unsharp and the lighting is uninteresting. If you have the possibility, try to include all of the head inside the frame, and crop off some of the jumper. 4.', '2005-02-12 11:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164962, 143653, 27845, '<td valign="top">An interesting picture. Reminds me of my own submission, although I didn''t go quite as far. The pose is very dramatic, but I think it doesn''t suggest pain that well. The colour cast is nice, it adds to the overall effect. 7.</td>', 'An interesting picture. Reminds me of my own submission, although I didn''t go quite as far. The pose is very dramatic, but I think it doesn''t suggest pain that well. The colour cast is nice, it adds to the overall effect. 7.', '2005-02-12 11:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164965, 145147, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. It suggests pain woíthout having persons in the image. The torn picture holds a whole story. The faded roses and the ring add to the athmosphere of the photograph. The only thing I don''t like is the composition. It lacks dimension, everything is lying flat on the table. 7.</td>', 'I like the concept. It suggests pain woíthout having persons in the image. The torn picture holds a whole story. The faded roses and the ring add to the athmosphere of the photograph. The only thing I don''t like is the composition. It lacks dimension, everything is lying flat on the table. 7.', '2005-02-12 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164967, 145122, 27845, '<td valign="top">This picture is rather about immediate death than about pain, but that''s something which depends very much from the point of view. For me, it''s too gross. For the picture as such I can''t find too many appealing elements either. You pushed the contrast too far and the background, which takes about a third of the picture doesn''t add to the image. 3.</td>', 'This picture is rather about immediate death than about pain, but that''s something which depends very much from the point of view. For me, it''s too gross. For the picture as such I can''t find too many appealing elements either. You pushed the contrast too far and the background, which takes about a third of the picture doesn''t add to the image. 3.', '2005-02-12 11:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164968, 143464, 27845, '<td valign="top">Why did you not use a real person for this picture? I think it would have been more interesting then. 6.</td>', 'Why did you not use a real person for this picture? I think it would have been more interesting then. 6.', '2005-02-12 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164969, 145076, 8522, '<td valign="top">Amazing concept, very inventive take on challenge. I don''t like the square crop though, and wish the legs were more to the side of the frame.</td>', 'Amazing concept, very inventive take on challenge. I don''t like the square crop though, and wish the legs were more to the side of the frame.', '2005-02-12 11:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164970, 143132, 27845, '<td valign="top">I have now thought some time about this shot and the title and still can''t figure out what you''re referring to. All I see is an (interesting) tree, which has nothing to do with pain, at least nothing I can see. Maybe this is some kind of ''hidden face'' picture? 4.</td>', 'I have now thought some time about this shot and the title and still can''t figure out what you''re referring to. All I see is an (interesting) tree, which has nothing to do with pain, at least nothing I can see. Maybe this is some kind of ''hidden face'' picture? 4.', '2005-02-12 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164971, 145108, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle colours and the detail on the door. The composition bothers me a little, as the woman''s looking outside the frame, which she is too close to. If the was looking to the left, it would be much better. 6.</td>', 'I like the subtle colours and the detail on the door. The composition bothers me a little, as the woman''s looking outside the frame, which she is too close to. If the was looking to the left, it would be much better. 6.', '2005-02-12 11:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164973, 144604, 8522, '<td valign="top">Centered compositions are rarely effective, in this case the monk should be on the left of the frame, as he is facing the right. I don''t really see the connection to pain in this shot.</td>', 'Centered compositions are rarely effective, in this case the monk should be on the left of the frame, as he is facing the right. I don''t really see the connection to pain in this shot.', '2005-02-12 11:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164977, 145168, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The girl takes in about half of the frame and is really close to the watcher. This along with the well-applied DOF make me connect to her immediately. The title allows some interpretations which all go into the same direction. You might be referring to the hallway which is blocked by the man. Or it is linked to the man''s addiction to alcohol, which is suggested by the bottle in his hand, which he took along outside the flat. The third, and most striking interpretation that occured to me is that for the girl there is no way out of this relationship.<br/>The only thing that bothers me is the girls black eye. The picture works well enough without it, and would allow for the spectator''s imagination to get going.<br/>10. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this one. The girl takes in about half of the frame and is really close to the watcher. This along with the well-applied DOF make me connect to her immediately. The title allows some interpretations which all go into the same direction. You might be referring to the hallway which is blocked by the man. Or it is linked to the man''s addiction to alcohol, which is suggested by the bottle in his hand, which he took along outside the flat. The third, and most striking interpretation that occured to me is that for the girl there is no way out of this relationship.The only thing that bothers me is the girls black eye. The picture works well enough without it, and would allow for the spectator''s imagination to get going.10. Good luck.', '2005-02-12 11:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164979, 145120, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, could have been helped with some attention to detail, not only in the spelling of the title... it''s a shame that the tip of the shoe is missing, and that plug sockets are visible in the top-right corner of the frame. If the background had no distracting elements, this would have been a very strong shot.</td>', 'Nice idea, could have been helped with some attention to detail, not only in the spelling of the title... it''s a shame that the tip of the shoe is missing, and that plug sockets are visible in the top-right corner of the frame. If the background had no distracting elements, this would have been a very strong shot.', '2005-02-12 11:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164980, 144389, 8522, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, very striking imagery.</td>', 'Amazing shot, very striking imagery.', '2005-02-12 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164983, 145009, 27845, '<td valign="top">Shame on you for taking advantage of a child''s injury! Just kidding ;) The pain is visible all right. The mask on the child''s head tell me he didn''t see a stair or something. The hand on the left is distracting, because we cannot see the person it belongs to.<br/>Your frame might be a little more to the left, and your lighting is too direct. The childs face is too bright and there are annoying reflections in the eyes, the jewelry and the jumper. 5.</td>', 'Shame on you for taking advantage of a child''s injury! Just kidding ;) The pain is visible all right. The mask on the child''s head tell me he didn''t see a stair or something. The hand on the left is distracting, because we cannot see the person it belongs to.Your frame might be a little more to the left, and your lighting is too direct. The childs face is too bright and there are annoying reflections in the eyes, the jewelry and the jumper. 5.', '2005-02-12 11:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164985, 143091, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your picture is too small. Go for 640 as longest side of your picture. The problem eoth this photograph is that it''s only link to the challenge is in the title. Without is, the shot would never ever suggest pain. 2.</td>', 'Your picture is too small. Go for 640 as longest side of your picture. The problem eoth this photograph is that it''s only link to the challenge is in the title. Without is, the shot would never ever suggest pain. 2.', '2005-02-12 11:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
