(1166773, 144849, 27605, '<td valign="top">Seems to me to be just adequate in meeting the challenge.  Still scored a "7" from me based mostly on those awesome trees.   I would have cropped the first  2 or 3 grave markers out.</td>', 'Seems to me to be just adequate in meeting the challenge.  Still scored a "7" from me based mostly on those awesome trees.   I would have cropped the first  2 or 3 grave markers out.', '2005-02-13 20:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
