(1167276, 144829, 16829, '<td valign="top">The picture has some interest, but out of focus isn''t the same as soft focus. The lack of detail and predominant digital noise detract from it. You need to stay within the boundaries of what your camera can do. (I curse that fact every day!) What if you had to submit this without a title? What would you expect people to take away from this shot? I just don''t like titles that "explain" the picture.</td>', 'The picture has some interest, but out of focus isn''t the same as soft focus. The lack of detail and predominant digital noise detract from it. You need to stay within the boundaries of what your camera can do. (I curse that fact every day!) What if you had to submit this without a title? What would you expect people to take away from this shot? I just don''t like titles that "explain" the picture.', '2005-02-14 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
