(1167881, 145099, 14656, '<td valign="top">A little ambiguous without context or facial expression of the vaulter. Difficult to tell if that''s the pole or the bar.</td>', 'A little ambiguous without context or facial expression of the vaulter. Difficult to tell if that''s the pole or the bar.', '2005-02-14 05:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
