(1167949, 145010, 14656, '<td valign="top">Not feeling the "border" of this image. Best to keep it simple. And why would the knife be positioned horizontally? Shouldn''t it be vertical? Heinz? I have a craving for french fries now.</td>', 'Not feeling the "border" of this image. Best to keep it simple. And why would the knife be positioned horizontally? Shouldn''t it be vertical? Heinz? I have a craving for french fries now.', '2005-02-14 05:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
