(1169179, 143618, 26679, '<td valign="top">The composition is strong here</td>', 'The composition is strong here', '2005-02-14 16:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169182, 145059, 26679, '<td valign="top">for some a score like this would be deep joy. Great idea..</td>', 'for some a score like this would be deep joy. Great idea..', '2005-02-14 16:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169183, 144941, 26679, '<td valign="top">ooohhh   I feel that.....</td>', 'ooohhh   I feel that.....', '2005-02-14 16:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169184, 144795, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and everything is so sharp.</td>', 'I like the composition, and everything is so sharp.', '2005-02-14 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169187, 145165, 26679, '<td valign="top">Wow, you have a great pain capture here</td>', 'Wow, you have a great pain capture here', '2005-02-14 16:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169189, 143193, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great light. Sharp focus, tight composition.  If there is a flaw in the photo it might be a somewhat less than compelling actor.  We cannot assert that we think she is not really feeling pain, we simply feel she fails to share it with us.</td>', 'Great light. Sharp focus, tight composition.  If there is a flaw in the photo it might be a somewhat less than compelling actor.  We cannot assert that we think she is not really feeling pain, we simply feel she fails to share it with us.', '2005-02-14 16:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169190, 144888, 26679, '<td valign="top">It would probably help if I knew what Tylenol is. It is not something I have come accress before. However the symbolism is strong...</td>', 'It would probably help if I knew what Tylenol is. It is not something I have come accress before. However the symbolism is strong...', '2005-02-14 16:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169195, 144893, 33560, '<td valign="top">Fun and colorful action photo.</td>', 'Fun and colorful action photo.', '2005-02-14 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169200, 143656, 29557, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA</td>', 'HAHAHA', '2005-02-14 16:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169209, 145171, 33560, '<td valign="top">Why is it that we find it impossible to believe that neatly coiffed men never experience pain?  This makes it makes this harder to believe.  The tension between the real , live, temporary sadness and the everlasting and ever-dead  ''hope'' of carved stone makes the photo interesting.</td>', 'Why is it that we find it impossible to believe that neatly coiffed men never experience pain?  This makes it makes this harder to believe.  The tension between the real , live, temporary sadness and the everlasting and ever-dead  ''hope'' of carved stone makes the photo interesting.', '2005-02-14 16:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169216, 143865, 33560, '<td valign="top">Normally I hate grizzly photos; but here there is drammatic tension.  The deed has not been done. A powerful and haunting image.  The razor sharp focus on the eye instead of the instrument of damage was a good choice and the lighting is just about perfect.  Finally, I appreciate being able to see the bottom of the eye through the slot in the blade.</td>', 'Normally I hate grizzly photos; but here there is drammatic tension.  The deed has not been done. A powerful and haunting image.  The razor sharp focus on the eye instead of the instrument of damage was a good choice and the lighting is just about perfect.  Finally, I appreciate being able to see the bottom of the eye through the slot in the blade.', '2005-02-14 16:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169217, 144822, 29557, '<td valign="top">i can feel it myself! @#)$*U</td>', 'i can feel it myself! @#)$*U', '2005-02-14 16:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169221, 145067, 29557, '<td valign="top">superb detail, very nice!</td>', 'superb detail, very nice!', '2005-02-14 16:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169222, 144898, 29557, '<td valign="top">the sepia really works well in this shot, well done!</td>', 'the sepia really works well in this shot, well done!', '2005-02-14 16:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169224, 145075, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a clever concept.  And it''s an unusual presentation.  It looks almost deliberately amateurish (as opposed to accidentally amateurish)  But it is really quite unconvincing.</td>', 'It''s a clever concept.  And it''s an unusual presentation.  It looks almost deliberately amateurish (as opposed to accidentally amateurish)  But it is really quite unconvincing.', '2005-02-14 17:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169225, 145120, 29557, '<td valign="top">Hah! Great idea. only thing I can say about the composition is the crop should have included the rest of the handle, top of the foot, and not included the few elements in the upper right hand side. However, still one of my top picks.</td>', 'Hah! Great idea. only thing I can say about the composition is the crop should have included the rest of the handle, top of the foot, and not included the few elements in the upper right hand side. However, still one of my top picks.', '2005-02-14 17:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169227, 145029, 29557, '<td valign="top">incredibly graphic, well layed out. colors are dead on, no pun intended.</td>', 'incredibly graphic, well layed out. colors are dead on, no pun intended.', '2005-02-14 17:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169228, 144626, 29557, '<td valign="top">painfully controversial...? I like it!@</td>', 'painfully controversial...? I like it!@', '2005-02-14 17:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169229, 144339, 29557, '<td valign="top">chill out man.. it''ll get better. bumping up!</td>', 'chill out man.. it''ll get better. bumping up!', '2005-02-14 17:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169230, 144893, 29557, '<td valign="top">I hope you didn''t plan this(your) child to fall. His unhappy face says you may have. I like it!</td>', 'I hope you didn''t plan this(your) child to fall. His unhappy face says you may have. I like it!', '2005-02-14 17:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169231, 145163, 29557, '<td valign="top">always a big fan of macro shots. i wish the dof included more. still a good shot</td>', 'always a big fan of macro shots. i wish the dof included more. still a good shot', '2005-02-14 17:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169233, 145076, 29557, '<td valign="top">i love photos that have a story that continues on after seeing them.</td>', 'i love photos that have a story that continues on after seeing them.', '2005-02-14 17:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169234, 144961, 33560, '<td valign="top">Wow, the minimalist approach.  I actually find the writing and two dots to be too distracting.  I wonder if we could have figured it out without them; I bet we could.  And it is customary to have some part of the photograph in focus - or all of it quite out of focus.  To make all of it just a bit out of focus will always convince us there is a flaw in photo.  <br/> <br/>I really like the idea, the lighting, the composition, and so on; but the flaws really get in the way.</td>', 'Wow, the minimalist approach.  I actually find the writing and two dots to be too distracting.  I wonder if we could have figured it out without them; I bet we could.  And it is customary to have some part of the photograph in focus - or all of it quite out of focus.  To make all of it just a bit out of focus will always convince us there is a flaw in photo.   I really like the idea, the lighting, the composition, and so on; but the flaws really get in the way.', '2005-02-14 17:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169235, 145061, 29557, '<td valign="top">great composition, dof is excellent</td>', 'great composition, dof is excellent', '2005-02-14 17:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169237, 144448, 27399, '<td valign="top">I lost two friends in an accident before, I know how that feels and this photo brought that back.  Very painful.</td>', 'I lost two friends in an accident before, I know how that feels and this photo brought that back.  Very painful.', '2005-02-14 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169243, 144170, 33560, '<td valign="top">I get it, It''s a blood orange!  The blood is convincing.  I know this is an almost ridiculous quibble, but it looks like a cheap knife - one that could not cut through a tomato.  And this makes me fear it ever-so-much less.  This loss of respect for the instrument causes the photo''s impact to unravel quickly.  As a rule I hate gore in photos, but the humor - intended or not- makes up for this.</td>', 'I get it, It''s a blood orange!  The blood is convincing.  I know this is an almost ridiculous quibble, but it looks like a cheap knife - one that could not cut through a tomato.  And this makes me fear it ever-so-much less.  This loss of respect for the instrument causes the photo''s impact to unravel quickly.  As a rule I hate gore in photos, but the humor - intended or not- makes up for this.', '2005-02-14 17:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169261, 144826, 33560, '<td valign="top">The lighting is fantastic.  I love the wrinkles in the man''s skin, and the highlights in the hair. The bokeh of the water behind him is great.  I am green with envy over this much of the photo - I hope I might one day do as well.  <br/> <br/>I don''t get the whole diamond thing going onin the left third of the photo. I find this really distracting and wonder if the photo could have been cropped just inside this. Even if this had meant losing some more of the hands, I think this would have helped. This would have allowed cropping of the vast black area in the sweater also.  This would purge the photo of all unnecessary clutter.  <br/> <br/>The statement of pain is subtle but clear.  After looking at photos in this area for several hours, this puts this photo among the ten or twenty best in the category.  Really good job!</td>', 'The lighting is fantastic.  I love the wrinkles in the man''s skin, and the highlights in the hair. The bokeh of the water behind him is great.  I am green with envy over this much of the photo - I hope I might one day do as well.   I don''t get the whole diamond thing going onin the left third of the photo. I find this really distracting and wonder if the photo could have been cropped just inside this. Even if this had meant losing some more of the hands, I think this would have helped. This would have allowed cropping of the vast black area in the sweater also.  This would purge the photo of all unnecessary clutter.   The statement of pain is subtle but clear.  After looking at photos in this area for several hours, this puts this photo among the ten or twenty best in the category.  Really good job!', '2005-02-14 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169264, 144967, 33560, '<td valign="top">Clever and nicely realized.  The highlights on the left side of the apple are ''blown'' and I hate gore.  The metaphor is very communicative</td>', 'Clever and nicely realized.  The highlights on the left side of the apple are ''blown'' and I hate gore.  The metaphor is very communicative', '2005-02-14 17:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169268, 144822, 33560, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo.  Perfect lighing, composition, focus, bokeh.</td>', 'Stunning photo.  Perfect lighing, composition, focus, bokeh.', '2005-02-14 17:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169271, 145077, 33560, '<td valign="top">Puerile</td>', 'Puerile', '2005-02-14 17:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169279, 145177, 33560, '<td valign="top">Guys who look like this are always cast as dumb petty officials - sergeants, sheriffs, and so on.  And we are conditioned to believe them incapable of tenderness or pain.  Ordinarily this conditioning is so strong that seeing is not believing.  Yet in this case the expression of grief seems pretty convincing.<br/> <br/>Technically, the photo seems just about ideally realized.  The man''s face and the flowers express almost all of the full range of values from white to dark gray, leaving just the right gap between the shadows of the subject and the background. Lighting and focus are perfect.    This could be the best of the bunch.  <br/> <br/>(I would have edited out that little pin prick of light halfway between forehead and alstroemeria petal.  And I find two or three eyebrow hairs just a little distracting; but these are the merest of trifling quibbles.)</td>', 'Guys who look like this are always cast as dumb petty officials - sergeants, sheriffs, and so on.  And we are conditioned to believe them incapable of tenderness or pain.  Ordinarily this conditioning is so strong that seeing is not believing.  Yet in this case the expression of grief seems pretty convincing. Technically, the photo seems just about ideally realized.  The man''s face and the flowers express almost all of the full range of values from white to dark gray, leaving just the right gap between the shadows of the subject and the background. Lighting and focus are perfect.    This could be the best of the bunch.   (I would have edited out that little pin prick of light halfway between forehead and alstroemeria petal.  And I find two or three eyebrow hairs just a little distracting; but these are the merest of trifling quibbles.)', '2005-02-14 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169280, 144389, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice lghting.</td>', 'Nice lghting.', '2005-02-14 17:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169287, 144895, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like political statements in photographs, but I find that the most persuasive ones are the subtle and unargumentative.  In this sense the photo is unconvincing.  But it is visually strong.</td>', 'I like political statements in photographs, but I find that the most persuasive ones are the subtle and unargumentative.  In this sense the photo is unconvincing.  But it is visually strong.', '2005-02-14 17:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169292, 143843, 33560, '<td valign="top">This cat may be the most convincing actor of the lot.  And the photo is very nicely taken.  It''s good humor and cuteness are much more effective at reaching us, I think, than some of the other approaches. Nice.</td>', 'This cat may be the most convincing actor of the lot.  And the photo is very nicely taken.  It''s good humor and cuteness are much more effective at reaching us, I think, than some of the other approaches. Nice.', '2005-02-14 17:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169296, 145029, 33560, '<td valign="top">The pain here is the viewers.  Gruesome.</td>', 'The pain here is the viewers.  Gruesome.', '2005-02-14 17:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169303, 144215, 33560, '<td valign="top">A pretty photo of an evidently pretty place.  The pain element seems a little too subtle.</td>', 'A pretty photo of an evidently pretty place.  The pain element seems a little too subtle.', '2005-02-14 17:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169304, 143473, 33560, '<td valign="top">Droll.</td>', 'Droll.', '2005-02-14 17:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169310, 145094, 33560, '<td valign="top">Okay,  most of the photos that project pain on inanimate objects strike me badly.  But the whimsy of this photo and its brilliant execution force me to make a considerable exception in this case. Nice job.</td>', 'Okay,  most of the photos that project pain on inanimate objects strike me badly.  But the whimsy of this photo and its brilliant execution force me to make a considerable exception in this case. Nice job.', '2005-02-14 17:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169374, 143841, 26679, '<td valign="top">Painfull Juice, I like this image</td>', 'Painfull Juice, I like this image', '2005-02-14 18:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169493, 143841, 33640, '<td valign="top">Nice piece - love the color in both the apple and the nails. <br/>Perhaps a different lighting direction could have added a stronger tone to the shot though, and by looking at it, it feels like you spent too much time thinking about the placing of the nails (I do that all the time when it comes to positioning in images). Also, to convey more pain, breaking the apple up a tiny bit would have added an interesting touch.<br/>All in all though, it''s a good image. Very nice focus on detailed areas and the white contrast is very flattering to the subject. <br/>Good work :)</td>', 'Nice piece - love the color in both the apple and the nails. Perhaps a different lighting direction could have added a stronger tone to the shot though, and by looking at it, it feels like you spent too much time thinking about the placing of the nails (I do that all the time when it comes to positioning in images). Also, to convey more pain, breaking the apple up a tiny bit would have added an interesting touch.All in all though, it''s a good image. Very nice focus on detailed areas and the white contrast is very flattering to the subject. Good work :)', '2005-02-14 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
