(1169958, 143039, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very good representation of the challenge!  I like the toning, sharpness and depth of field here, too.  My only nitpicks would be the shadow (although it gives it an Anthony Perkins-style Psycho feel), and the blown out areas of the hand.  A 9 from me.</td>', 'Very good representation of the challenge!  I like the toning, sharpness and depth of field here, too.  My only nitpicks would be the shadow (although it gives it an Anthony Perkins-style Psycho feel), and the blown out areas of the hand.  A 9 from me.', '2005-02-14 22:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169961, 143136, 3102, '<td valign="top">Quite a low-quality image, I''m afraid.  I''m sure you''re hearing this from a lot of people... but do take advantage of the 640 pixel size here, and try to compress the image less.  To give you an idea of what I mean... you can submit shots up to 150K -- yours is only 6K.</td>', 'Quite a low-quality image, I''m afraid.  I''m sure you''re hearing this from a lot of people... but do take advantage of the 640 pixel size here, and try to compress the image less.  To give you an idea of what I mean... you can submit shots up to 150K -- yours is only 6K.', '2005-02-14 22:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169964, 144358, 3102, '<td valign="top">Too small to judge properly... you''ll definitely benefit from submitting larger shots, and with less compression.  You can submit files up to 150K -- yours is only 13K...</td>', 'Too small to judge properly... you''ll definitely benefit from submitting larger shots, and with less compression.  You can submit files up to 150K -- yours is only 13K...', '2005-02-14 22:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
