(1170714, 144389, 27108, '<td valign="top">Great Shot! Like the idea, the inspiration of a guy of taking his life that way is a reflection of too much pain indeed. Damn Scissors!  (those were big!) :D<br/>Face Expression: Decided! he ain´t gonna chicken out!  but a little bit of scaryness in his face would have been great also I think. Anyways, I think this shot deserves a Ten points ;)</td>', 'Great Shot! Like the idea, the inspiration of a guy of taking his life that way is a reflection of too much pain indeed. Damn Scissors!  (those were big!) :DFace Expression: Decided! he ain´t gonna chicken out!  but a little bit of scaryness in his face would have been great also I think. Anyways, I think this shot deserves a Ten points ;)', '2005-02-15 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170718, 143084, 27108, '<td valign="top">Great Photo!  I give it a 10!    Some may say that there is too much brightness.. but what a heck... The baby is "coming" out to light! ;) (well, he aint coming out bandaged but in this case its ok).. also the light could be cause he has a big hospital white lamp over.. Anyways.. (again) Great Shot!</td>', 'Great Photo!  I give it a 10!    Some may say that there is too much brightness.. but what a heck... The baby is "coming" out to light! ;) (well, he aint coming out bandaged but in this case its ok).. also the light could be cause he has a big hospital white lamp over.. Anyways.. (again) Great Shot!', '2005-02-15 10:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170720, 143473, 27108, '<td valign="top">LOL!!  of the 213 entries to this challenge (at least when I voted were 213) this one is the funniest of all, and at the same time I like the lightning, and... of course the Action Man!! :D   so I had to give this shot 10 points (I gave only 3 in total) :D</td>', 'LOL!!  of the 213 entries to this challenge (at least when I voted were 213) this one is the funniest of all, and at the same time I like the lightning, and... of course the Action Man!! :D   so I had to give this shot 10 points (I gave only 3 in total) :D', '2005-02-15 10:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
