(1172050, 145144, 18799, '<td valign="top">Already voted, returning for comments. What a great capture of not only pain, but also compassion ans sportsmanship.   I think I may have played with the crop a little as I''m not totally sold on this one - but then again, I don''t know what you had to work with.  In any event, the emotive strengths of the image far outweigh any technical issues, particularly those that are subjective.  This one gets a 9</td>', 'Already voted, returning for comments. What a great capture of not only pain, but also compassion ans sportsmanship.   I think I may have played with the crop a little as I''m not totally sold on this one - but then again, I don''t know what you had to work with.  In any event, the emotive strengths of the image far outweigh any technical issues, particularly those that are subjective.  This one gets a 9', '2005-02-15 22:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
