(1172517, 145170, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moose101:</b></div><hr/><i>I got a elbow infection from the wire (guess I should have been more careful), still taking pills for the infection.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>I hope you''ve had a tetanus shot in the last few years too, although by now it''d be too late.<br/> <br/>I trust you''re not setting a new bar for effort required to win a ribbon! A pretty powerful shot with a theme and composition similar to one I did, but much better done.</td>', 'Originally posted by moose101:I got a elbow infection from the wire (guess I should have been more careful), still taking pills for the infection. I hope you''ve had a tetanus shot in the last few years too, although by now it''d be too late. I trust you''re not setting a new bar for effort required to win a ribbon! A pretty powerful shot with a theme and composition similar to one I did, but much better done.', '2005-02-16 00:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
