(1172639, 145032, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scalvert:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on yet another top 10, Brad. *yawn*<br/>Guess you had a leg up on the competition, huh? Man, I wish I could''ve found something like this. Oh wait... I did. ;-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=147635" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17203/thumb/147635.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17203/thumb/147635.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17203/thumb/147635.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/><b>ROFL</b> <br/> <br/>Wish I had a zoom and could have cropped this one better when I shot it:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=147641" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/147641.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/147641.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/147641.jpg"/></a> <br/>The "Weapon" wasn''t optimal on that one...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-16 00:58:34.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by scalvert: Congrats on yet another top 10, Brad. *yawn*Guess you had a leg up on the competition, huh? Man, I wish I could''ve found something like this. Oh wait... I did. ;-)   ROFL  Wish I had a zoom and could have cropped this one better when I shot it: The "Weapon" wasn''t optimal on that one...', '2005-02-16 00:57:21.000000', '2005-02-16 00:58:34.000000', 0),
