(1172773, 145010, 30861, '<td valign="top">To all who asked, it''s jalapeno sauce, not ketchup. The pain came when I licked it off my dinger. This was a last-minutes shot, I''d just downloaded NeatImage and wanted to play with it. Wasn''t meant to be taken seriously and it wasn''t...<br/> <br/>If anything, I see it as a sort of tongue-in-cheek homage to the old B-film slasher movies...<br/> <br/>The border was fun to do, I wanted a "slipped" feel to the whole thing.<br/> <br/>Thanx all to those who commented.<br/> <br/></td>', 'To all who asked, it''s jalapeno sauce, not ketchup. The pain came when I licked it off my dinger. This was a last-minutes shot, I''d just downloaded NeatImage and wanted to play with it. Wasn''t meant to be taken seriously and it wasn''t... If anything, I see it as a sort of tongue-in-cheek homage to the old B-film slasher movies... The border was fun to do, I wanted a "slipped" feel to the whole thing. Thanx all to those who commented. ', '2005-02-16 01:22:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1172775, 145170, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon!', '2005-02-16 01:22:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1172784, 144670, 31489, '<td valign="top">It''s the first pic I''ve posted here for a challenge, and I have to admit, I hardly really tried.<br/> <br/>This was mostly in response to some terrible news I had received only a couple days before, and I was really upset. It deserved the score it got, and I don''t feel bad about it one bit. Just trying to create something that let out what I was feeling at the time helped a lot.</td>', 'It''s the first pic I''ve posted here for a challenge, and I have to admit, I hardly really tried. This was mostly in response to some terrible news I had received only a couple days before, and I was really upset. It deserved the score it got, and I don''t feel bad about it one bit. Just trying to create something that let out what I was feeling at the time helped a lot.', '2005-02-16 01:24:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1172804, 144605, 31889, '<td valign="top">About what I expected.....<br/> <br/>FYI...this wasn''t my credit card statement.  I was attempting to portray "a more modern pain" that most people can relate to in these days where debt is considered a normal part of life.<br/> <br/></td>', 'About what I expected..... FYI...this wasn''t my credit card statement.  I was attempting to portray "a more modern pain" that most people can relate to in these days where debt is considered a normal part of life. ', '2005-02-16 01:29:25.000000', NULL, 0),
