(1172888, 145170, 27847, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeneralE:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moose101:</b></div><hr/><i>I got a elbow infection from the wire (guess I should have been more careful), still taking pills for the infection.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>I hope you''ve had a tetanus shot in the last few years too, although by now it''d be too late.<br/> <br/>I trust you''re not setting a new bar for effort required to win a ribbon! A pretty powerful shot with a theme and composition similar to one I did, but much better done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Trust me  Im not setting any new bars  for me its just normal  and thats to get punished one way or another ;-) But yes, this time it paid off.<br/> <br/>Tetanus shot, yes Ive had one done a few years back. Actually, thats a whole other story that but I can tell you that I had my last tetanus shot at about 8AM on January 1st, 2000. Lets just say it was a good New Years Party ;-)<br/> <br/>Yes, exciting to have my first ribbon. Thanks<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeneralE:</b></div><hr/><i> similar to one I did...</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was going to check it out but finding it in your massive profile is like searching for a needle in a hay stack ;-) ... I''ll have to check it out in the morning. <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by GeneralE: Originally posted by moose101:I got a elbow infection from the wire (guess I should have been more careful), still taking pills for the infection. I hope you''ve had a tetanus shot in the last few years too, although by now it''d be too late. I trust you''re not setting a new bar for effort required to win a ribbon! A pretty powerful shot with a theme and composition similar to one I did, but much better done.   Trust me  Im not setting any new bars  for me its just normal  and thats to get punished one way or another ;-) But yes, this time it paid off. Tetanus shot, yes Ive had one done a few years back. Actually, thats a whole other story that but I can tell you that I had my last tetanus shot at about 8AM on January 1st, 2000. Lets just say it was a good New Years Party ;-) Yes, exciting to have my first ribbon. Thanks Originally posted by GeneralE: similar to one I did...  I was going to check it out but finding it in your massive profile is like searching for a needle in a hay stack ;-) ... I''ll have to check it out in the morning. ', '2005-02-16 01:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
