(1172943, 144895, 31049, '<td valign="top">This was one of the few entries that I felt expressed the idea of pain without actually displaying it visually. Definitely deserved more. As for photo editing software, I strongly recommend the free (and open source) GIMP (just google for it). Extremely powerful, though it takes some time to learn.</td>', 'This was one of the few entries that I felt expressed the idea of pain without actually displaying it visually. Definitely deserved more. As for photo editing software, I strongly recommend the free (and open source) GIMP (just google for it). Extremely powerful, though it takes some time to learn.', '2005-02-16 01:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1172967, 144913, 13084, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''m so excited to receive the first ribbon!  I went to India on a 2 wk business trip and have just got back this week.  For this challenge, I only had a chance to post the photo, but had absolutely no time to participate in the voting.  Thank you all for your votes and encouragement. I''m glad you could also feel the pain in this photo.</td>', 'Wow! I''m so excited to receive the first ribbon!  I went to India on a 2 wk business trip and have just got back this week.  For this challenge, I only had a chance to post the photo, but had absolutely no time to participate in the voting.  Thank you all for your votes and encouragement. I''m glad you could also feel the pain in this photo.', '2005-02-16 02:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1172973, 144892, 31049, '<td valign="top">Wow, 24 comments on my second challenge ever! And a jump of more than 40 places. I feel the DPC community is really helping me focus on photography better. Thanks again for the comments, everyone. As I said, all credit goes to strain2k, whose idea I shamelessly stole.</td>', 'Wow, 24 comments on my second challenge ever! And a jump of more than 40 places. I feel the DPC community is really helping me focus on photography better. Thanks again for the comments, everyone. As I said, all credit goes to strain2k, whose idea I shamelessly stole.', '2005-02-16 02:10:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1172974, 143039, 27735, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jayrod:</b></div><hr/><i> Even though this looks like it was staged for this challenge, it seems a bit more honest and candid than the others. The hair on the model''s face is a really nice touch. Seems like it was touched up very well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No touch-up required. This was a candid shot of an actual haircut in progress.</td>', 'Originally posted by jayrod: Even though this looks like it was staged for this challenge, it seems a bit more honest and candid than the others. The hair on the model''s face is a really nice touch. Seems like it was touched up very well.   No touch-up required. This was a candid shot of an actual haircut in progress.', '2005-02-16 02:11:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1172975, 145087, 31307, '<td valign="top">Geez, some people have no sense of humor.  I think that montereykiddo''s parallel between this shot and pornography is a little bit of a stretch.  Sure some people will object to it for various reasons, but the ramifications of a porn shot do not also carry over into shots like this.  The cat suffered no harm and won''t have to worry about whether or not it''s pregnant. What do you mean it''s not "right in this challenge?"  I''m sorry if I sound too aggressive, but seriously, learn to get thicker skin people.</td>', 'Geez, some people have no sense of humor.  I think that montereykiddo''s parallel between this shot and pornography is a little bit of a stretch.  Sure some people will object to it for various reasons, but the ramifications of a porn shot do not also carry over into shots like this.  The cat suffered no harm and won''t have to worry about whether or not it''s pregnant. What do you mean it''s not "right in this challenge?"  I''m sorry if I sound too aggressive, but seriously, learn to get thicker skin people.', '2005-02-16 02:11:21.000000', NULL, 0),
