(1173039, 145061, 25655, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue!<br/>This one is wonderful! True pain without being revolting.<br/>Not that this one is an "easy view". Makes me feel the pain so well.<br/>But it''s a wonderful photo in any way. The DOF is great, the toning do wonders, the grain works so well...<br/>You are so well deserve your ribbon!</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue!This one is wonderful! True pain without being revolting.Not that this one is an "easy view". Makes me feel the pain so well.But it''s a wonderful photo in any way. The DOF is great, the toning do wonders, the grain works so well...You are so well deserve your ribbon!', '2005-02-16 02:41:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1173050, 144855, 16790, '<td valign="top">I liked this one, gave it a 7.  I think you did a good job of conveying pain... the negative space really works for it by giving it a sense of isolation.  As others said, though, it is a tad dark.  Just a bit of curves adjustment would really give this photo some oomph.</td>', 'I liked this one, gave it a 7.  I think you did a good job of conveying pain... the negative space really works for it by giving it a sense of isolation.  As others said, though, it is a tad dark.  Just a bit of curves adjustment would really give this photo some oomph.', '2005-02-16 02:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
