(1173798, 145061, 18349, '<td valign="top">WOW... not only is this a dreaded kid shot, but it also has the evil noise too!  LOL<br/> <br/>I''m so tickled that this won.  I was kind of apprehensive about submitting it but I thought it represented pain very well and was something that could be universally related to no matter where you''re from.  Working with kids for over 10 years in middle and high schools, I''ve see this kind of pain frequently.  I''m glad that others could connect with my vision.  Thanks so much y''all!  :o)</td>', 'WOW... not only is this a dreaded kid shot, but it also has the evil noise too!  LOL I''m so tickled that this won.  I was kind of apprehensive about submitting it but I thought it represented pain very well and was something that could be universally related to no matter where you''re from.  Working with kids for over 10 years in middle and high schools, I''ve see this kind of pain frequently.  I''m glad that others could connect with my vision.  Thanks so much y''all!  :o)', '2005-02-16 09:37:05.000000', NULL, 0),
