(1175222, 144947, 32672, '<td valign="top">Very, very, very great shot.  If I had seen it during the voting phase, I would''ve given it a 10.  This is the ultimate pain, and I love that seeing this picture makes us stop and realize that once more.  Overall this did well in the challenge, but I wonder why it didn''t do better.  THe low marks baffle me.</td>', 'Very, very, very great shot.  If I had seen it during the voting phase, I would''ve given it a 10.  This is the ultimate pain, and I love that seeing this picture makes us stop and realize that once more.  Overall this did well in the challenge, but I wonder why it didn''t do better.  THe low marks baffle me.', '2005-02-16 16:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
