(1175699, 145061, 21714, '<td valign="top">Congratulation Laurie. Looks like I am a bit late :)<br/>Really enjoyed this one, and I am sure that almost eveyone of us can relate to one of the sides in the image in some way. I sure can and loved the way you had captured it. And I bow now.</td>', 'Congratulation Laurie. Looks like I am a bit late :)Really enjoyed this one, and I am sure that almost eveyone of us can relate to one of the sides in the image in some way. I sure can and loved the way you had captured it. And I bow now.', '2005-02-16 19:34:54.000000', NULL, 0),
