(1175870, 145170, 4285, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon first off. Second I didn''t vote but I have to say this is one of the few that actually captured "pain" in the shot. Well deserved ribbon. Hope the elbow heals soon.</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon first off. Second I didn''t vote but I have to say this is one of the few that actually captured "pain" in the shot. Well deserved ribbon. Hope the elbow heals soon.', '2005-02-16 20:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1175896, 145061, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great representation of pain Laurie. Especially poignant with the increased incidents of bullying in today''s society. I think you really captured the feeling of a kid who doesn''t fit in. Congrats on the ribbon. Very moving.</td>', 'Great representation of pain Laurie. Especially poignant with the increased incidents of bullying in today''s society. I think you really captured the feeling of a kid who doesn''t fit in. Congrats on the ribbon. Very moving.', '2005-02-16 20:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
