(1176460, 144026, 28359, '<td valign="top">snackwells; you know it. The shot actually goes in the fat tissue of the stomach. Thank God for co-pays.</td>', 'snackwells; you know it. The shot actually goes in the fat tissue of the stomach. Thank God for co-pays.', '2005-02-16 23:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1176570, 144643, 32672, '<td valign="top">Sailingduck is right...looks like the doggy could use a little dental stuff.  A vet can do the whole whammie, but if you want to go cheap, Petco or a similar store sells stuff like dental chew toys, Greenies (these edible green bone thingies that clean their teeth--they love ''em), pet toothbrushes with chicken/beefy toothpaste, etc.<br/>Good, clear shot; you can even see the whiskers clearly.  It''s true that it looks a little acted, but I''m certianly glad the bite wasn''t for real!</td>', 'Sailingduck is right...looks like the doggy could use a little dental stuff.  A vet can do the whole whammie, but if you want to go cheap, Petco or a similar store sells stuff like dental chew toys, Greenies (these edible green bone thingies that clean their teeth--they love ''em), pet toothbrushes with chicken/beefy toothpaste, etc.Good, clear shot; you can even see the whiskers clearly.  It''s true that it looks a little acted, but I''m certianly glad the bite wasn''t for real!', '2005-02-17 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1176824, 145170, 31742, '<td valign="top">i knew this would win when i saw it .. congrats!!!!</td>', 'i knew this would win when i saw it .. congrats!!!!', '2005-02-17 03:13:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1176841, 144894, 9581, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfull idea fits challenge too.. Did you use flash? Flash has become my worse enemy:) Photographers can tell because a flash lights up in front of subject and washes out any detail that may be there. I just bought me a 100 halagen light gonna start playing soon and any high watts that you can use like say with a desk lamp  would be better then flash.. If you didnt use flash then something to reflect and block some of the bright spots may help:) <br/> <br/> Awesome nails for this shot too.... You dont see them often! :) Keep up the great work:)</td>', 'This is wonderfull idea fits challenge too.. Did you use flash? Flash has become my worse enemy:) Photographers can tell because a flash lights up in front of subject and washes out any detail that may be there. I just bought me a 100 halagen light gonna start playing soon and any high watts that you can use like say with a desk lamp  would be better then flash.. If you didnt use flash then something to reflect and block some of the bright spots may help:)   Awesome nails for this shot too.... You dont see them often! :) Keep up the great work:)', '2005-02-17 03:30:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1176851, 145147, 9581, '<td valign="top">Ugh I hate seeing the outcome of this on voting... 1''s for this geez people are so judgemental and out for themselves... there is no way I would score less then 4 and if I had of voted a 6 would be great:) Work on sizing your photo so others can see more pc eyes and some old eyes need big :) 640 x 480 This is really well for your first challenge! Be proud 4.5 , and I can not say or pick on anything  here:)</td>', 'Ugh I hate seeing the outcome of this on voting... 1''s for this geez people are so judgemental and out for themselves... there is no way I would score less then 4 and if I had of voted a 6 would be great:) Work on sizing your photo so others can see more pc eyes and some old eyes need big :) 640 x 480 This is really well for your first challenge! Be proud 4.5 , and I can not say or pick on anything  here:)', '2005-02-17 03:37:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1177202, 144945, 24073, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, and the subject here to me is portrayed just fine.  The picture does look a little bit heavy on the right side, and the grass on the left side is large enough to become distracting.  Other than that I certainly think it portrays pain, and couldn''t help feeling sorry for the subject.</td>', 'Nice picture, and the subject here to me is portrayed just fine.  The picture does look a little bit heavy on the right side, and the grass on the left side is large enough to become distracting.  Other than that I certainly think it portrays pain, and couldn''t help feeling sorry for the subject.', '2005-02-17 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1177232, 145147, 31738, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tolovemoon:</b></div><hr/><i> Ugh I hate seeing the outcome of this on voting... 1''s for this geez people are so judgemental and out for themselves... there is no way I would score less then 4 and if I had of voted a 6 would be great:) Work on sizing your photo so others can see more pc eyes and some old eyes need big :) 640 x 480 This is really well for your first challenge! Be proud 4.5 , and I can not say or pick on anything  here:) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by tolovemoon: Ugh I hate seeing the outcome of this on voting... 1''s for this geez people are so judgemental and out for themselves... there is no way I would score less then 4 and if I had of voted a 6 would be great:) Work on sizing your photo so others can see more pc eyes and some old eyes need big :) 640 x 480 This is really well for your first challenge! Be proud 4.5 , and I can not say or pick on anything  here:) ', '2005-02-17 09:13:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1177238, 145147, 31738, '<td valign="top">I actually had a hard time sizing the image due to the fact that when I scaled it 640x480, the KB size still remained over 150. So I had to keep scaling it down until I got it about 150 KB. The idea was there but the picture could of came out much better than I wanted it to be. It was my first challenge. I do appreciate your comments, I''m learning more and more because of nice poeple like you. Thank you<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-20 19:13:50.</i></td>', 'I actually had a hard time sizing the image due to the fact that when I scaled it 640x480, the KB size still remained over 150. So I had to keep scaling it down until I got it about 150 KB. The idea was there but the picture could of came out much better than I wanted it to be. It was my first challenge. I do appreciate your comments, I''m learning more and more because of nice poeple like you. Thank you', '2005-02-17 09:18:22.000000', '2005-02-20 19:13:50.000000', 0),
