(1177299, 143194, 22734, '<td valign="top">Rising the concept of the challenge by meeting it with a masterful addition of humor. Painful entertainnebt. Congratulations on your 11th placing. Top twenty is always good.</td>', 'Rising the concept of the challenge by meeting it with a masterful addition of humor. Painful entertainnebt. Congratulations on your 11th placing. Top twenty is always good.', '2005-02-17 10:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
