(1177355, 144895, 22734, '<td valign="top">Impressive, as it portrays the lethal aspect of a force that can be used for good and evil. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Impressive, as it portrays the lethal aspect of a force that can be used for good and evil. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2005-02-17 10:28:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1177482, 145061, 20679, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot Laurie. Very deserving of the ribbon!</td>', 'Outstanding shot Laurie. Very deserving of the ribbon!', '2005-02-17 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1177687, 144998, 7364, '<td valign="top">If euskadi gave you a 10, where did it go?  Looks like zero 10s on the board to me.  Anyway, yes, nice photo.  I agree that the lighting coul dbe improved... need more contrast by making the light more intense.  This could have been accomplished in the camera with a longer shutter/widder app, but then you would have over exposed the shoulder.  I''m guessing that  your shoulder was pretty close to the light source?  The neck and arm aren''t overdone.  So move the source a little further away so it''s not too intense in any one area and get a brighter exposure.  <br/> <br/>Here''s a bonus idea... since the challenge is about pain... immitate sweat with some baby oil.</td>', 'If euskadi gave you a 10, where did it go?  Looks like zero 10s on the board to me.  Anyway, yes, nice photo.  I agree that the lighting coul dbe improved... need more contrast by making the light more intense.  This could have been accomplished in the camera with a longer shutter/widder app, but then you would have over exposed the shoulder.  I''m guessing that  your shoulder was pretty close to the light source?  The neck and arm aren''t overdone.  So move the source a little further away so it''s not too intense in any one area and get a brighter exposure.   Here''s a bonus idea... since the challenge is about pain... immitate sweat with some baby oil.', '2005-02-17 14:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1178144, 144898, 14656, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gloda:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gloda:</b></div><hr/><i>This looks and feels like a typical jjbeguin shot.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oops...sorry ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>With 21 ribbons to his name, no offense taken!</td>', 'Originally posted by gloda: Originally posted by gloda:This looks and feels like a typical jjbeguin shot. Oops...sorry ;)  With 21 ribbons to his name, no offense taken!', '2005-02-17 17:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1178684, 144138, 18349, '<td valign="top">I thought this would place higher... well done!  :o)</td>', 'I thought this would place higher... well done!  :o)', '2005-02-17 20:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1178729, 145061, 20662, '<td valign="top">Yikes! I just have not been paying attention. I just now realized that this fine photo belonged to you. <br/> <br/>Congratulations! Excellent! Marvelous!  You''ve come a long way baby!</td>', 'Yikes! I just have not been paying attention. I just now realized that this fine photo belonged to you.  Congratulations! Excellent! Marvelous!  You''ve come a long way baby!', '2005-02-17 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1179081, 145061, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hi, Congratulations !!I want you to know that this simple photo deserved the blue ribbon. I originally gave this a 6, thought It was above average, and I probably should of scored this a 7. It deserved it.  It''s a nice photo that me and my whole family look at all the time. This photo speaks a thousand words.Great job...congratulations !</td>', 'Hi, Congratulations !!I want you to know that this simple photo deserved the blue ribbon. I originally gave this a 6, thought It was above average, and I probably should of scored this a 7. It deserved it.  It''s a nice photo that me and my whole family look at all the time. This photo speaks a thousand words.Great job...congratulations !', '2005-02-18 00:27:44.000000', NULL, 0),
