(1882794, 143781, 26464, '<td valign="top">great photojournalistic style shot. it doesn''t fit the classic ''clean'' background that a lot of ribboners get here. but very emotive, great idea. the dog looks like it actually understands what you were doing. <br/></td>', 'great photojournalistic style shot. it doesn''t fit the classic ''clean'' background that a lot of ribboners get here. but very emotive, great idea. the dog looks like it actually understands what you were doing. ', '2005-11-19 12:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
