(6092997, 145061, 60047, '<td valign="top">I just thought I''d let you know that this shot is one of the first that I came across back in 2006 when I first discovered DPC. I found it to be very powerful then and in the ensuing years I''ve come back to it and found it to be just as powerful. I then realized that I never made it a favorite. That''s fixed, now. Congrats on a magnificent shot.</td>', 'I just thought I''d let you know that this shot is one of the first that I came across back in 2006 when I first discovered DPC. I found it to be very powerful then and in the ensuing years I''ve come back to it and found it to be just as powerful. I then realized that I never made it a favorite. That''s fixed, now. Congrats on a magnificent shot.', '2010-07-14 17:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
